<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">EN_KTLT kuf_Katu,⋅Western_ltr Wed Mar 05 2025 09:33:59 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">John</para>
  <para style="toc1">Taruuih Liêm Jang</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jang</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jhn</para>
  <para style="mt">Jang</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Tarnââp ve Paraaq, Paraaq tơơt palơq Yaang Pleng, lơq Paraaq nek Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Ađó ơi ve tââq tarnââp palơq Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Dyóp rau ganơơm Ađó bâân tavaaih, lơq xók kah bâân tavaaih tââq Ađó, hayơq kah marau marâ bâân vaaih. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Kalóóng Ađó nek parmông, lơq parmông nek rau brương ưng akóón manưih <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Rau brương dyóól kalóóng bóng kanam, lơq bóng kanam kah đươk lơh rau brương.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Ve mưi chanak bâân kayua tââq Yaang Pleng, achak ưng ađó nek Jang. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Ađó ơi bhral kalóóng tarnêêng manưih truuih buôn ađó ve chóóm truuih đuui leq rau brương, hơq đóng tââq ađó, dyóp ngaai ve chóóm huuiq. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Chênh ađó achêk eh rau nek rau brương, bơơi ađó ơi bhral đóng ađó truuih đuui leq rau brương. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Rau brương lalua, nek rau brương dyóól brương dyóp manưih, ơi bhral leq kalóóng hóng katiêk. <verse eid="JHN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Ađó ơi tơơt kalóóng hóng katiêk, lơq hóng katiêk bâân tavaaih tââq Ađó, hơq hóng katiêk kah đơơp n'nal Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Ađó ơi vôôiq tơk dhiq mađó leq Ađó, hơq dhanuôr mađó leq Ađó kah pơh đơơp Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Bơơi tabhơt nôôq manưih pơh đơơp Ađó, nek Ađó đóng leq piđó mataai val xar akóón anaaq ưng Yaang Pleng, nek đóng leq nôôq ngaai huuiq dhiq dhanóók Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Nôôq manưih achêk eh rau bâân n'niên tââq parhââm ahaam, kung eh tââq rââm kiêng achak araang, môôiq tââq karnóq akóón manưih, bơơi nek tââq Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="JHN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Paraaq ơi val xar achak araang lơq tơơt jaq m'pơng nôôq he, lơq nôôq he ơi ngel móng cha-iil tabah ưng Ađó, i kơi cha-iil tabah ưng Akóón Mưi bhral tââq Ama, bing bhlaai ơơn phươk liêm nek palơq paraaq dhalam. <verse eid="JHN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Jang truuih đuui leq Ađó lơq karơ dhariêng, praaq kơi ađô: “Ađô nek Yaang đu aku ơi móón: ‘Yaang bhral tatun aku ơi val xar bhi chap lơh aku, ơi Ađó biêh ve loom aku.’” <verse eid="JHN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Ơi yuur bhral tââq rau xưa raai ưng Ađó, tabhơt nôôq he pei đơơp bhơt ơơn phươk liêm ađô tơk ơơn phươk liêm tôôh. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Taai gani ơi bâân pajaau đóng dhiq Môôi-se; ơơn phươk liêm lơq paraaq dhalam ơi bhral tââq Jê-su Chuôq Paq manưih. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Kah ngaai glêh móng lêi Yaang Pleng. Chapiên Akóón Mưi Yaang Pleng, Yaang tơơt kalóóng lóóm Ama, chênh Yaang achêk lók pakah leq Ama.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Ađô nek paraaq truuih ưng Jang xók manưih Jo Thaaiq kayua nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih lơq manưih Lê-vi tââq Jê-ru-sa-leem tơk buôn tamóh ađó: “Amei nek ngaai?” <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Ađó đơơp pakah truuih karơ — kah mơ ve dyiin bơơi đơơp móón — kơi ađô: “Aku eh rau nek Chuôq Paq Manưih.” <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Palââng tamóh ađó: “Kơi ađek nek ng'kơi? Amei alua nek Ê-li?” Ađó ââi: “Aku eh rau.” “Amei alua nek Manưih Đââng Taruuih?” Ađó ââi: “Eh.” <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Kơi ađek hayơq, piđó móón palơq ađó: “Amei nek ngaai, đóng nôôq yi ve chóóm ve xayar ââi bóóp leq nôôq manưih ơi kayua nôôq yi vôôiq? Hau amei praaq leq amei kala?” <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Ađó ââi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">“Aku nek dhariêng praaq yuur tar-auq kalóóng kruung vơng:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">‘Phaai têêng tapat charhóóng ploong kalơng ưng Chuôq,’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 1:23">kơi Ê-saai manưih loom đââng taruuih ơi móón.” <verse eid="JHN 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Nôôq manưih bâân kayua biêh mađó kabhuh manưih Pha-ri-si, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />piđó tamóh padhiêr ađó, lơq praaq palơq ađó: “La amei eh rau nek Chuôq Paq Manưih, kung eh rau Ê-li, môôiq Manưih Loom Đââng Taruuih, kơi ađek nek hau kơq amei têêng bap-teem?” <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Jang ââi bóóp piđó, kơi ađô: “Aku têêng bap-teem palơq đơơk. Bơơi Yaang ơi dyương dhiq m'pơng nôôq pe hơq nôôq pe kah n'nal, <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />nek Yaang bhral tatun aku; Yaang đu aku kah chóóm đaang buôn lêh tarlêi chauq jêi ưng Ađó.” <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Nôôq tarnêêng achêk yuur vaaih dhiq Bê-tha-ni hót tôôh karuung Jô-đen, dhiq đu Jang biêh dyơq têêng bap-teem. <verse eid="JHN 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Tangêi tatun, Jang lêi Chuôq Jê-su vôôiq leq hót ađêi, hơq móón kơi ađô: “Lêi tôôh, Trưưu Akóón ưng Yaang Pleng, Yaang pei lơơi matu lơt ưng akóón manưih aq! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Chêk nek leq Yaang ađek đu aku ơi móón: ‘Manưih bhral tatun aku nek Yaang biêh bhi chap lơh aku, taai Ađó ơi biêh ve loom aku.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Aku kah n'nal Ađó, bơơi buôn Ađó bâân tapakah leq dhanuôr I-sơ-ra-êên, aku bhral têêng bap-teem palơq đơơk taai rau tarnêêng achêk.” <verse eid="JHN 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Jang ơi truuih đuui, xók praaq kơi ađô: “Aku ơi lêi Yaang Liêm tââq pleng dhaluônh jaq kơi achim paraap, lơq bóq dhiq Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Aku kung kah n'nal ngaai Ađó, bơơi Yaang kayua aku têêng bap-teem palơq đơơk, Yaang achêk praaq palơq aku: ‘Dhiq m'piing dhơ dhangaai đu akóón lêi Yaang Liêm dhaluônh jaq lơq bóq dhiq ađó, nek manưih achêk nek Yaang têêng Bap-teem palơq Chuôq Yaang Liêm.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Hayơq aku ơi móng lêi lơq truuih đuui kơi ađô, ađôk nek Akóón Yaang Pleng.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Machu dyơq, dhiq tangêi patet kơơq, Jang dyơq dyương palơq bơơr kalóóng sôôq nôôq môôn-đô ưng ađêi, <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />lơq xók lêi Chuôq Jê-su vôôiq lalơh, ađó móón: “Lêi tôôh, Trưưu Akóón ưng Yaang Pleng!” <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Bơơr môôn-đô achêk ưng Jang xâng móón kơi achêk hơq nhiđó vôôiq ting Chuôq Jê-su. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Xók Chuôq Jê-su hangiêk lóóiq lơq lêi nhi bơơr dyơq ting ađêi, Ađó tamóh nhi bơơr: “Bơơr nhưa chêk ngaai?” Nhi bơơr ââi paraaq Ađó: “Ra-bi (dhanóók ađô bâân lók kiêng móón nek ‘Thêi’), Thêi tơơt n'dhiq?” <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Ađó praaq palơq nhi bơơr: “Nek vôôiq hayơq adhi anó e lêi.” Kơi achêk nek nhi bơơr vôôiq, lêi dham Ađó dyơq tơơt, lơq nhi bơơr ơi tơơt lóóiq palơq Ađó xók tangêi ađek. Bhêêl achêk nek mơ jơ đu majêt. <verse eid="JHN 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Mưi kalóóng bơơr nak ơi xâng tââq Jang lơq vôôiq ting Chuôq Jê-su nek En-rê, adhi padruuih ưng Si-môôn Phi-e-rơ. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Laloom tabhơt, ađó chêk lum anó ưng ađêi nek Si-môôn hayơq truuih lóóiq palơq anó, kơi ađô: “Nôôq yi ơi lum Yaang Bâân Xut Dhơu” (dhanóók ađô bâân lók nek Chuôq Paq Manưih). <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Ađó đââng anó ađêi tơk leq Chuôq Jê-su. Kơi xók lêi ađó, Chuôq Jê-su móón: “Amei nek Si-môôn, akóón ưng Jang. Amei e bâân đóók nek Sê-pha” (achak achêk bâân lók nek Phi-e-rơ).<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Tangêi tatun, Chuôq Jê-su kiêng xooq tââq ađek vôôiq leq Ga-li-lê, lơq Ađó chêk lum Phi-liip hayơq kayua ađó ađek: “Amei ting Aku.” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Phi-liip manưih gluh tââq Bêêt-saai-đa, nek tââq kanóón ưng En-rê lơq Phi-e-rơ. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Phi-liip chêk lum Na-tha-na-êên lơq móón palơq ađó ađek: “Nôôq yi tame bâân n'nal Yaang đu Môôi-se ơi xaraq kalóóng gani lơq nôôq manưih loom đââng taruuih kung kơi chêk — nek Jê-su, akóón ưng Jô-seep, tââq Na-xa-reet.” <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Bơơi Na-tha-na-êên ââi lóóiq ađó: “Ve chóóm vaaih hau rau parhei gluh tââq Na-xa-reet hơ?” Phi-liip móón palơq ađó: “Hêq vôôiq lơq lêi.” <verse eid="JHN 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Chuôq Jê-su lêi Na-tha-na-êên xók tơk leq Ađó, nek Ađó praaq lơq akonh ađek: “Lêi nô, mưi manưih I-sơ-ra-êên dhalam tapat, kah ve rau galơơk chachââr dhiq kalóóng manưih ađô!” <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Na-tha-na-êên tamóh Ađó: “N'đó tââq Amei n'nal aku?” Chuôq Jê-su ââi, Ađó praaq palơq akonh ađek kơi ađô: “Xók kah ơi Phi-liip dhaloong amei, bhêêl dyơq tơơt jaruh tââm tarung, hayơq Aku ơi lêi amei.” <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Na-tha-na-êên ââi palơq Ađó: “Ra-bi, Amei nek Akóón Yaang Pleng! Amei nek Bhua ưng I-sơ-ra-êên!” <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi lóóiq lơq praaq palơq ađó: “Ve alua amei huuiq taai Aku ơi móón palơq amei kơi ađô: ‘Aku ơi lêi amei dhiq jaruh tââm tarung’? Amei e lêi nôôq tarnêêng đu chrih liêm lơh kơi ađôk dyơq.” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Hayơq Chuôq praaq palơq ađó: “Alua, alua, Aku móón palơq adhi anó, adhi anó e lêi pleng yuur tayaah, lơq nôôq dhơn ưng Yaang Pleng dyók dhaluônh dhiq Akóón Manưih.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Mót tangêi đu pe, mưi bhiêk nhan manưih yuur têêng dhiq Ka-na xưưq Ga-li-lê, amêêq ưng Chuôq Jê-su tơơt dhiq ađek. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Chuôq Jê-su lơq nôôq môôn-đô Ađó kung bâân kayua pơh bhiêk nhan manưih. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Xók buôh hariêq bhơt, amêêq ưng Chuôq Jê-su móón palơq Ađó: “Palââng kah ve buôh dyơq.” <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Lơq Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó: “Amêêq ơơi, rau ađek hau pâng kre tơk aku lơq amei? Jơ ưng aku kah ơi tơk.” <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Amêêq ưng Ađó móón palơq nôôq dhơn ratơơq: “Phaai ting têêng dhơ dharau đu Ađó ađek kayua nôôq pe.” <verse eid="JHN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Dhiq ađek ve chapat beq bhaang palơq dhơl bâân lơơi pantua đóng tarnêêng kajut pasek ưng manưih Jo Thaaiq, mưi beq kađôôq đuôh mơ bơơr tơk pe jêt ng'kó đơơk. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Chuôq Jê-su yua piđó: “Nek toh tabing đơơk leq nôôq bhaang ađek.” Hayơq piđó toh bing đơơk tơk teer bóóp. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Xók đôk nek chik lơq đââng leq manưih kala bhiêk.” Kơi chêk nek, piđó vôôiq đââng. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Bơơi xók manưih kala bhiêk, bip xâng đơơk ơi bâân xar vaaih buôh (hơq ađó kah n'nal n'tââq ađó ve, bơơi nôôq dhơn ratơơq — nek nôôq manưih ơi chik đơơk achêk — hayơq n'nal), manưih kala bhiêk dhaloong chaxaau <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />lơq móón palơq ađó: “Dyóp ngaai biêh yaauq buôh iêm laloom, lơq xók tamóói ơi ơm ból, nek yaauq buôh m'bưưiq jêên lơh. Hayơq amei nek koom buôh iêm tơk leq bhêêl đôk.” <verse eid="JHN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Ađôk nek kanal chrih tarnââp Chuôq Jê-su ơi têêng dhiq Ka-na, xưưq Ga-li-lê, Ađó pakah cha-iil tabah ưng ađêi, lơq nôôq môôn-đô Ađó ơi huuiq dhiq Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Xong tarnêêng ađek, Chuôq Jê-su, amêêq Ađó, lơq nôôq adhi padruuih, palơq nôôq môôn-đô Ađó dhuônh leq kanóón Ka-bê-na-um, bơơi piđó tơơt dhiq ađek kah ve bơk tangêi.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Bhiêk Jalơh ưng manưih Jo Thaaiq ơi đan tơk, nek Chuôq Jê-su đơk tơk Jê-ru-sa-leem. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Ađó lêi kalóóng đong bhanuôih nôôq đu baan karók, trưưu lơq paraap; palơq kabhuh raxal jêên tơơt dhiq ađek. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Xók xong klaanh mưi m'beq tarnaach palơq tarlêi, Ađó chuih bhơt kabhuh piđó gluh tââq đong bhanuôih, nek palơq trưưu lơq karók, Ađó kung vươk chêh xu ưng kabhuh raxal jêên lơq talâh baang ưng piđó. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Ađó praaq palơq nôôq đu baan paraap: “Phaai paxooq nôôq rau ađek gluh tââq đôk. Óóq têêng đong Ama ưng Aku xar dham kơl baan.” <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Nôôq môôn-đô Ađó hei lóóiq paraaq ơi xaraq, kơi ađô: “Bhơt lóóm leq đong Chuôq e óch róh akóón.” <verse eid="JHN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Taai rau ađek, manưih Jo Thaaiq ơi ââi lóóiq lơq praaq palơq Ađó: “Amei pakah đóng nôôq yi lêi hau karnal chrih xók amei têêng nôôq tarnêêng ađô?” <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi bóóp, Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Nek rơh pahư đong bhanuôih ađôk, hayơq kalóóng pe tangêi Aku e kadhơng ađó lóóiq.” <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Kơi ađek nek, manưih Jo Thaaiq móón: “Đong bhanuôih ađô bâân têêng kalóóng puôn jêt chapat kamó, hơq Amei e kadhơng ađó lóóiq kalóóng pe tangêi?” <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Dhơ kơi ađek, đong đu Ađó biêh praaq tơk chaleq leq đong bhanuôih ưng achak araang Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Kơi chêk hayơq, xók Ađó ơi tââq kan chêt mamông lóóiq, nôôq môôn-đô ưng Ađó hei lóóiq kơi Ađó ơi praaq kơi ađek, nek piđó huuiq Bha-aar Yaang Pleng lơq paraaq đu Chuôq Jê-su ơi praaq.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Kơi lââng, xók bhêêl Ađó tơơt dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem mót tangêi Bhiêk Jalơh, dhiq kabhuh manưih ganơr, bơk manưih huuiq dhiq dhanóók Ađó xók lêi nôôq karnal chrih đu Ađó ơi têêng. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Dhơ kơi ađek, chênh Chuôq Jê-su kah đóng lóóm huuiq Ađêi leq piđó, taai Ađó n'nal bhơt dyóp manưih, <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />ađek nek Ađó kah ve kơng tơk mơ ngaai ađek phaai truuih đuui leq palââng, taai Ađó tư n'nal hau rau tơơt kalóóng dyóp ngaai.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Kơi ađek bơơi, ve mưi nak manưih mađó kabhuh Pha-ri-si, mưi manưih têêng akoq ưng dhanuôr Jo Thaaiq, achak ađó nek Ni-kô-đeem. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Abhươp ađô tơk lum Chuôq Jê-su xók hayum kanam, lơq praaq palơq Chuôq Jê-su: “Thêi ơơi, nôôq yi n'nal kơi Amei nek manưih pachóóm bhral tââq Yaang Pleng, taai kah ngaai manưih ve chóóm tavaaih nôôq kanal chrih ađô, nek nôôq rau Amei yuur têêng, la Yaang Pleng kah tơơt palơq manưih achêk.” <verse eid="JHN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi bóóp lơq praaq palơq ađó: “Alua, alua, Aku praaq palơq amei, la ngaai kah bâân n'niên lóóiq, nek manưih achêk kah ve chóóm bâân lêi katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng.” <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Ni-kô-đeem móón palơq Ađó: “Ng'kơi têêng mưi nak, xók nek mưi abhươp takóh, ve chóóm bâân n'niên lóóiq? Ve kơq manưih ađek ve chóóm mót kalóóng luônh amêêq ađêi chu đu bơơr hayơq bâân n'niên lóóiq hơ?” <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi: “Alua, alua, Aku praaq palơq amei, la ngaai manưih kah bâân yuur n'niên tââq đơơk lơq Yaang Liêm, nek manưih ađek kah chóóm mót leq kalóóng katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Hau rau bâân n'niên tââq achak araang nek achak araang, lơq hau rau bâân n'niên tââq Yaang Liêm nek yaang. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Óóq chrih xâng xók aku ơi praaq palơq amei: ‘Rau kơng tââm đóng amei nek bâân n'niên lóóiq.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Adhiiq pruung n'đó leq ađó kiêng, lơq amei bâân xâng dhariêng ưng ađó, bơơi amei kah n'nal adhiiq bhral n'đó tââq môôiq adhiiq vôôiq n'đó tơk. Nek kung kơi ađek nek palơq dhơ dhangaai bâân yuur n'niên tââq Yaang Liêm.” <verse eid="JHN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Ni-kô-đeem praaq kơơq lơq tamóh Ađó: “Ng'kơi têêng tarnêêng ađek ve chóóm bâân yuur vaaih?” <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi lóóiq lơq praaq palơq ađó: “Amei nek manưih pachóóm ưng dhanuôr I-sơ-ra-êên hơq amei kah n'nal nôôq rau ađek hơ? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Alua, alua Aku praaq palơq amei kơi nôôq yi praaq leq rau đu nôôq yi ơi n'nal, lơq nôôq yi truuih đuui leq rau đu nôôq yi ơi lêi, dyơq nôôq pe kah pei đơơp paraaq truuih ưng nôôq yi. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />La aku ơi praaq đóng nôôq pe leq nôôq tarnêêng dhiq katiêk hơq nôôq pe dyơq kah huuiq, nek ng'kơi têêng nôôq pe e huuiq la aku praaq đóng nôôq pe leq nôôq tarnêêng dhiq pleng? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Kah ngaai ơi glêh dyók leq pleng nguôi tââq Yaang ơi dhaluônh tââq pleng — achêk nek Akóón Manưih. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Môôi-se ơi yuur yông kaxênh kalóóng kruung vơng n'đó kơi, nek Akóón manưih kơng phaai bâân yuur tayông i kơi achêk, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />đóng dyóp ngaai huuiq leq Ađó maar ve parmông taluôn luôn.<verse eid="JHN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Ơi Yaang Pleng kuôq nh'nhơr manưih hóng katiêk tơk mơ Ađó đóng Akóón Mưi ưng Ađó, hơq đóng tabhơt manưih huuiq leq Akóón achêk yươq bâân leng kaxiêt, bơơi ve bâân parmông taluôn luôn. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Ơi Yaang Pleng kah kayua Akóón dhaluônh leq manưih hóng katiêk đóng tabóq matu manưih hóng katiêk, bơơi buôn paq manưih talaang katiêk dhiq Akóón achêk. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Manưih huuiq dhiq Akóón achêk nek yươq bâân tabóq matu, dyơq ngaai kah huuiq nek ơi bâân tabóq matu aq, taai ơi kah huuiq tơk dhanóók Akóón Mưi ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Kơi lââng, ađô nek bha-aar matu, ađek nek: rau brương ơi mót leq hóng katiêk, bơơi palââng malóóch kiêng bóng kanam lơh rau brương ơi nôôq tarnêêng têêng ưng piđó nek môôp aak. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Taai dyóp ngaai têêng aak nek geet rau brương, lơq kah tơk palơq rau brương, buôn đóng nôôq tarnêêng têêng ưng ađêi yươq bâân tapakah. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Dhơ kơi ađek, ngaai têêng rau pâng dhalam nek tơk palơq rau brương, đóng nôôq tarnêêng ưng ađêi bâân tapakah kơi piđó bâân yuur têêng kalóóng Yaang Pleng.”<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Xong nôôq tarnêêng ađek, Chuôq Jê-su lơq nôôq môôn-đô Ađó vôôiq mót parah Ju-đê. Ađó tơơt lóóiq dhiq ađek palơq piđó lơq têêng bap-teem. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Dhơ kơi ađek, Jang kung dyơq têêng bap-teem dhiq At-nôôn đan Sa-liim, taai dhiq ađek ve bơk đơơk, dhanuôr manưih pơh tơk lơq đơơp bap-teem — <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />ơi Jang biêh kah ơi bâân kóóp tamót leq đong kanam. <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Kơi achêk nek, mưi garluh tarkaai yuur vaaih gluh tââq nôôq môôn-đô ưng Jang palơq mưi nak Jo Thaaiq leq dhale n'tót kajut pasek. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Hayơq piđó tơk leq Jang lơq móón palơq ađó: “Ra-bi, manưih ơi glêh tơơt palơq thêi hót tôôh karuung Jô-đen, đu thêi ơi truuih đuui leq manưih achêk, phaai lêi tôôh, ađó ađek xók têêng bap-teem, lơq tabhơt dhanuôr manưih xók pơh tơk leq ađó achêk.” <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Jang ââi lóóiq lơq praaq: “Palââng kah chóóm bâân đơơp rau, mưi rau kung kah, la eh rau ađek nek rau ơi bâân tađóng leq manưih achêk tââq pleng. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Chênh adhi anó truuih đuui đóng aku nek aku ơi móón: ‘Aku eh rau nek Chuôq Paq Manưih,’ bơơi ađek nek ‘aku nek manưih bâân kayua bhral laloom Yaang achêk.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Ngaai nhan mamaai hơq nek chaxaau. Dyơq parjơơk ưng chaxaau, nek manưih dyương lơq tameng xâng ađó, hơq bâân đơơp rau bhuui taai dhariêng ưng chaxaau. Kơi chêk hơq, rau bhuui achêk ưng aku ơi bâân dyóp liêm. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Rau phaai têêng palơq Yaang achêk nek yuur bhi chap, dyơq palơq aku nek bhlêh pa-êêp.<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Yaang bhral tư tââq yaal nek dhiq m'piing pabhơt. Manưih gluh tââq katiêk nek mađó leq katiêk lơq praaq nôôq chiên mađó leq katiêk. Yaang bhral tââq pleng nek tơơt papiing pabhơt. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Ađó truuih đuui leq rau đu Ađó ơi lêi lơq xâng, bơơi kah ngaai pei đơơp paraaq truuih ưng Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Manưih ơi pei đơơp paraaq truuih đuui ưng Ađó hayơq móón kơi Yaang Pleng nek lalua dhalam. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Tââq Yaang đu Yaang Pleng ơi kayua bhral nek praaq paraaq ưng Yaang Pleng. Taai Ađó đóng Yaang Liêm ting kơi kah magađơq. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Ama nh'nhơr Akóón lơq ơi pajaau dyóp rau leq têi Akóón. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Ngaai huuiq dhiq Akóón hơq ve parmông taluôn luôn, dyơq ngaai kah xâng bóóp Akóón e kah ve lêi parmông, bơơi rau pagrâ janah ưng Yaang Pleng bhiêk tơơt dhiq manưih ađek.”<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Xong ađek, xók Chuôq Jê-su n'nal chiên nek manưih Pha-ri-si ơi xâng kơi Ađó yuur tavaaih lơq têêng bap-teem đóng bơk môôn-đô lơh Jang <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />(dhơ nek eh rau chênh Chuôq Jê-su têêng pheep bap-teem, bơơi nek nôôq môôn-đô ưng Ađó), <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />nek Ađó tââi tââq Ju-đê lơq val chô lóóiq Ga-li-lê. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Bơơi tarnêêng achêk yua chut Ađó phaai vôôiq hót Sa-ma-ri. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Kơi ađek nek Ađó vôôiq tơk mưi charvaal mađó parah Sa-ma-ri đóók nek Si-kha, đan phơn katiêk đu Ja-kôôp ơi blah leq Jô-seep, akóón padruuih ađó. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Dhiq ađô ve jiêng ưng Ja-kôôp. Xók ađek, taai Chuôq Jê-su ơi druôi nhưh taai tarnêêng parvôôiq, Ađó tơơt dhalam tóór jiêng. Bhêêl achêk nh'jau mơ jơ đu chapat. <verse eid="JHN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Mưi pađiil parkan mađó xưưq Sa-ma-ri tơk buôn dyêt đơơk, Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó: “Nhan đóng aku ơm đơơk.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Taai nôôq môôn-đô ưng Ađó ơi vôôiq mót kalóóng charvaal buôn piđó ve chóóm kơl chana padyơk. <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Xong ađek hayơq manưih pađiil parkan Sa-ma-ri móón palơq Ađó: “Ng'kơi têêng Amei, nek manưih Jo Thaaiq, kiêng nhan ơm đơơk tââq aku, nek mưi manưih pađiil parkan Sa-ma-ri?” (Taai manưih Jo Thaaiq kah tamóh tapraaq palơq manưih Sa-ma-ri.) <verse eid="JHN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi bóóp, lơq Ađó praaq palơq pađiil: “La amei ơi đơơp n'nal kaliim ưng Yaang Pleng, lơq ngaai nek manưih dyơq praaq palơq amei: ‘Nhan đóng aku ơm đơơk,’ nek amei alua dhakơi e nhan manưih ađek, lơq alua dhakơi ađó e đóng leq amei đơơk mamông.” <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Manưih pađiil parkan móón palơq Ađó: “Abhươp ơơi, amei kah ve chanik chik, lơq jiêng nek dhơuq. Kơi ađek, n'tââq hayơq amei ve đơơk mamông ađek? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Ve kơq nek amei gamak lơh Ja-kôôp, abhươp avuôq nôôq yi, ađó ơi lơơi đóng nôôq yi jiêng ađô, hơq chênh tââq ađek, ađó ơi ơm nek palơq akóón anaaq ađó lơq bhanan ưng ađó.” <verse eid="JHN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi lơq Ađó móón leq pađiil: “Dhơ dhangaai ơm tââq đơơk jiêng ađô e dyơq rahaal, <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />bơơi la ngaai ơm tââq đơơk đu aku đóng e kah ve mơ rahaal patơk taluôn luôn. Klóóih dhiq ađek, đơơk đu aku đóng e val xar tóm đơơk kalóóng manưih ađek bhlaai xưa parmông tơk taluôn luôn.” <verse eid="JHN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Manưih pađiil parkan móón palơq Ađó: “Abhươp ơơi, nhan đóng aku đơơk achêk hơq đóng aku yươq rau rahaal, lơq kung yươq kơng tơk ađôk buôn dyêt đơơk.” <verse eid="JHN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Ađó yua pađiil: “Phaai chô, dhaloong kayiik amei lơq val lóóiq leq ađô.” <verse eid="JHN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Manưih pađiil parkan móón kơơq, lơq ađó móón palơq Jê-su: “Aku kah ve kayiik.” Chuôq Jê-su móón leq ađó: “Amei móón dhalam bhlơng kơi: ‘Aku kah ve kayiik,’ <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Taai amei ơi ve xââng nak kayiik, lơq manưih đu amei ve xók đôk nek kung eh rau kayiik amei! Paraaq amei móón nek lalua!” <verse eid="JHN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Manưih pađiil parkan móón palơq Ađó: “Abhươp ơơi, aku lêi kơi amei nek mưi manưih đââng taruuih. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Abhươp avuôq nôôq yi bhuôih haanh dhiq bôôl ađô, dyơq nôôq pe móón kơi dham đu palââng phaai bhuôih haanh nek dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem.” <verse eid="JHN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó: “Nô anó, phaai huuiq aku, kơi jơ ravang tơk, nek bhêêl nôôq pe e bhuôih haanh Ama eh rau dhiq kakóóng ađô, kung eh rau dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Nôôq pe bhuôih haanh rau ađêi kah n'nal. Nôôq yi bhuôih haanh rau nôôq yi n'nal, taai rau paq jóói nek tââq manưih Jo Thaaiq. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Dhơ kơi ađek, jơ ravang tơk lơq xók đôk tơk, xók nôôq manưih bhuôih haanh lalua e bhuôih haanh Ama palơq lóóm ravaai lơq paraaq dhalam, taai Ama kung chik chêk nôôq manưih kơi ađek, nek nôôq ngaai bhuôih haanh Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Yaang Pleng nek Yaang, hơq ngaai bhuôih haanh Ađó phaai bhuôih haanh palơq lóóm ravaai, lơq praaq dhalam.” <verse eid="JHN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Manưih pađiil parkan móón palơq Ađó kơi ađô: “Aku n'nal Yaang Bâân Xut Dhơu (Yaang bâân đóók nek Chuôq Paq Manưih) ravang bhral. Xók Ađó bhral, chênh Ađó e truuih pakah dyóp tarnêêng leq nôôq yi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Chuôq Jê-su móón ađó: “Chênh nek aku, manưih dyơq praaq chiên palơq amei.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Bhêêl ađôk, nôôq môôn-đô Ađó val chô, lơq piđó lêi chrih taai Ađó dyơq praaq chiên palơq mưi pađiil parkan. Dhơ kơi ađek, kah ngaai tamóh: “Hau rau Thêi chêk?” môôiq: “Hau kơi Thêi praaq chiên palơq pađiil ađek?” <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Kơi ađek hayơq, manưih pađiil parkan lơơi lóóiq angóók đơơk ưng ađêi, ađó val mót kalóóng charvaal, lơq móón palơq dhanuôr manưih: <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Hêq vôôiq, lum mưi nak, đu manưih achêk ơi praaq leq aku tabhơt dyóp chiên aku biêh têêng. Kah alua ađek nek Chuôq Paq Manưih?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Piđó pajươk gluh tââq charvaal lơq tơk palơq Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Kalóóng mơ ganah ađek, nôôq môôn-đô panhel Ađó, móón: “Ra-bi ơơi, nhan nek cha.” <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Bơơi Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “Thêi ve tarmông buôn cha hơq adhi anó kah n'nal.” <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Kơi achêk hayơq, nôôq môôn-đô praaq palơq xóng ađêi: “Ve kơq mưi ngaai ađek ơi đââng tơk đóng Thêi cha?” <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “Chana padyơk ưng thêi ađek nek thêi têêng karnóq kiêng ưng Yaang kayua thêi lơq paxong tarnêêng ưng Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Kah alua adhi anó móón kơi ađô: ‘Dyơq puôn kaxe dyơq, hayơq nil chaxóót tơk’ hơ? Nô, aku praaq palơq adhi anó, phaai angơơq mat ađêi lơq yuur lêi nôôq hare aviq, taai piđó xók bhóók ravang đóng nil chaxóót! <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Manưih xóót đơơp jêên chaner lơq xóót peh rau mayưưm đóng parmông taluôn luôn, buôn hayơq manưih chóói lơq manưih xóót bhơt maar bhuui marhaal. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Taai paraaq xók đôk alua pâng, kơi ađô: ‘Manưih ađô nek đu chóói, lơq manưih lââng nek đu xóót.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Thêi kayua adhi anó xóót leh rau đu adhi anó kah rau gleh gleeng. Nôôq manưih lââng ơi gleh gleeng, dyơq adhi anó jađaang mót đươi kông praan ưng piđó.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Xók achêk, bơk manưih Sa-ma-ri tââq charvaal ađek tabóq lóóm huuiq dhiq Ađó ve paraaq manưih pađiil parkan truuih đuui, kơi ađô: “Ađó praaq palơq aku dyóp tarnêêng đu aku ơi têêng.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Kơi ađek hơq xók nôôq manưih Sa-ma-ri tơk lum Ađó, piđó nhan Ađó tơơt lóóiq palơq piđêi, lơq Ađó tơơt lóóiq dhiq ađek bơơr tangêi. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />N'dhương tatrul bơk manưih huuiq taai paraaq ưng Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Piđó móón palơq manưih pađiil parkan kơi ađô: “Nôôq yi kah dyơq huuiq ganơơm leq paraaq ưng amóóq dyơq, taai chênh nôôq yi ơi xâng, lơq nôôq yi n'nal kơi manưih ađô lalua nek Chuôq Paq ưng manưih hóng katiêk.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Bơơr tangêi tatun, Ađó xooq tââq ađek vôôiq leq Ga-li-lê. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Taai chênh Chuôq Jê-su ơi móón alua kơi mưi manưih đââng taruuih kah bâân bhi chap dhiq xưưq xaang ađêi. <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Kơi achêk hayơq, xók Ađó vôôiq tơk Ga-li-lê, dhanuôr Ga-li-lê pơh kêch Ađó, taai glêh lêi tabhơt dyóp tarnêêng Ađó ơi têêng dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem kalóóng ganah bhiêk, tââq piđó kung ơi vôôiq tơơt bhiêk.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Xong ađek, Ađó vôôiq lóóiq leq Ka-na kalóóng parah Ga-li-lê, dhiq đu Ađó ơi tavaaih đơơk xar buôh, lơq ve mưi chanak kuôn đong bhua achêk, akóón padruuih ưng ađó biêh dyơq vaaih ka-ai dhiq Ka-bê-na-um. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Xók xâng kơi Chuôq Jê-su tââq Ju-đê ơi chô tơk Ga-li-lê, akonh achêk vôôiq lum Ađó lơq nhan gavơh kơi đóng Ađó ve chóóm dhuônh lơq payươh đóng akóón padruuih ađêi, taai akóón n'niên ađek kanóq chêt. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Kơi achêk hayơq, Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó: “La nôôq pe kah lêi nôôq karnal chrih lơq nôôq tarnêêng chrih liêm, nek nôôq pe alua dhakơi kah huuiq.” <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Manưih kuôn đong bhua móón palơq Ađó: “Thêi ơơi, nhan nek dhuônh xók akóón aku yươq ơi chêt.” <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Chuôq Jê-su kayua ađó: “Nek chô aq, akóón padruuih amei dyơq mamông.” Manưih padruuih parkonh ađô huuiq paraaq đu Chuôq Jê-su ơi praaq palơq ađêi, lơq ađó yuur chô. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Xók bhêêl ađó dyơq vôôiq kalơng, nôôq dhơn ratơơq ưng ađó tơk lum ađó lơq truuih móón, móón kơi ađô akóón padruuih amei biêh dyơq mamông. <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Kơi ađek, ađó tho tamóh tââq piđó mót n'đó jơ hơq akóón n'niên ađek tââp xâng n'jang. Kơi achêk nek piđó ađek ââi palơq ađó kơi ađô: “Manua, mót jơ đu tapól, ka-ai kahiir gluh tââq akóón n'niên.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Ve kơi ađek, manưih akonh bâân n'nal kơi ađek nek mót bhêêl jơ đu Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó: “Akóón padruuih amei biêh mamông.” Chênh ađó huuiq nek palơq bhơt manưih đong ađêi. <verse eid="JHN 4:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Hayơq Chuôq Jê-su ơi val têêng kanal chrih đu bơơr ađô, xong xók vôôiq tââq Ju-đê tơk Ga-li-lê.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Xong nôôq tarnêêng achêk, ve mưi ganah bhiêk ưng manưih Jo Thaaiq, lơq Chuôq Jê-su yuur đơk tơk kanóón Jê-ru-sa-leem. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Xók achêk, dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem, hót Palóng Trưưu, ve mưi beq atông, bâân đóók nek Bê-têêt-đa kalóóng paraaq Hi-baaq-laai, ve xââng tanól japơơq tarpương. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Mưi kabhuh ganơr nôôq manưih ka-ai dhuôr, kabaang kapôk, khuch ke, rabóót dyung têi dyơq bêch dhiq nôôq dham kaang garvau ađô. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />(Taai mưi dhơn pleng ưng Chuôq, mót mưi ganah liêm kre, dhaluônh jaq leq atông lơq avơq paveq đơơk, kơi achêk hơq ngaai manưih jađaang dhaluônh laloom xók đơơk veq n'dhươi nek bâân yươh, dhơ mơk ka-ai dhơ dha kơi bhêêl achêk) <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Dhiq ađek ve mưi nak tôôh, mamông pe jêt takóól kamó mamông kalóóng dhuôr ka-ai ưng ađêi. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Xók Chuôq Jê-su lêi manưih ađô dyơq bêch dhiq ađek, lơq n'nal nek ađó ađek gleh mưi ganah ơi đươnh bhlơng, Chuôq praaq palơq ađó: “Amei kiêng bâân yươh kah?” <verse eid="JHN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Manưih ka-ai ââi bóóp Ađó: “Abhươp ơơi, aku kah ngaai ve đóng xók đơơk n'dhươi nek manưih achêk ve chóóm đââng aku dhuônh leq atông. Kơi lââng, xók bhêêl aku dyơq vôôiq dhaluônh leq atông, nek manưih lââng bhiêk dhaluônh laloom aku.” <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Chuôq Jê-su kayua ađó: “Nek yuur dyương, đuôl chong ưng amei yuur lơq jađaang vôôiq.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />N'drươh, manưih padruuih parkonh achêk val vaaih khe karơ kơi kaxu, ađó đuôl chong ađêi yuur, lơq jađaang vôôiq. Tangêi ađek nek tangêi Sa-baat.<verse eid="JHN 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Kơi ađek nek manưih Jo Thaaiq móón palơq ađó ơi bâân payươh yươh: “Mađôk nek tangêi Sa-baat, lơq kah đóng pheep amei đuôl chong ađêi.” <verse eid="JHN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Bơơi ađó ââi lóóiq piđó: “Manưih ơi têêng đóng aku khe karơ, chênh manưih achêk kayua aku: ‘Phaai đuôl chong amei yuur lơq jađaang vôôiq.’” <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Piđó tamóh ađó: “Ngaai nek manưih ơi kayua amei ‘Phaai đuôl chong yuur lơq jađaang vôôiq’?” <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Dhơ kơi ađek, manưih bâân payươh yươh kah n'nal ađek nek ngaai, taai Chuôq Jê-su ơi karluk mót leq ganơr manưih dyơq ve mat dhiq dham ađek. <verse eid="JHN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Lơh nôôq tarnêêng achêk, Chuôq Jê-su lum ađó kalóóng đong bhanuôih lơq Chuôq praaq palơq ađó: “Tôôh, amei ơi val vaaih khe karơ aq! Óóq têêng matu lơt dyơq, hơq đóng rau đu môôp lơh yươq vaaih tơk leq amei.” <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Manưih padruuih parkonh ađô yuur vôôiq lơq móón palơq manưih Jo Thaaiq kơi ađek nek Chuôq Jê-su, manưih ơi têêng đóng ađêi khe karơ. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Taai rau ađek, manưih Jo Thaaiq kóóp róp Chuôq Jê-su, taai Ađó ơi têêng nôôq tarnêêng achêk kalóóng tangêi Sa-baat. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Bơơi Chuôq Jê-su ââi lóóiq piđó: “Ama aku biêh dyơq têêng tarnêêng patơk xók đôk, aku kung têêng tarnêêng kơi ađek.” <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Taai paraaq ađô, hơq manưih Jo Thaaiq val kaang tabâân kơi leng Ađó taai Ađó eh chapiên rơh pahư tangêi Sa-baat, bơơi dyơq đóók Yaang Pleng nek Ama ađêi, tư têêng đóng ađêi marđơq palơq Yaang Pleng.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Kơi ađek hơq, Chuôq Jê-su ơi tar-ââi lơq praaq palơq piđó: “Alua, alua, aku praaq palơq nôôq pe, Akóón kah chóóm taai achak ađêi kala đóng têêng dhơ dharau tarnêêng, nguôi tââq hau dhơơm đu Akóón lêi Ama têêng, taai dhơ dharau tarnêêng Ama têêng nek nôôq tarnêêng achêk Akóón kung têêng kơi ađek. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Taai Ama nh'nhơr Akóón lơq pakah đóng Akóón dyóp rau đu chênh Ama têêng, hayơq Ađó e pakah đóng Akóón nôôq tarnêêng gamak lơh kơi ađôk dyơq đóng nôôq pe phaai chrih lêi. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Taai Ama têêng manưih chêt yuur dyương lơq đóng leq piđó parmông n'đó kơi, nek Akóón kung đóng parmông leq ngaai manưih Akóón kiêng kơi achêk. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Taai patơk mơ Ama kung kah praaq xêi ngaai, bơơi Ađó ơi pajaau bhơt mataai praaq xêi leq Akóón, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />đóng dyóp ngaai bhi chap Akóón kơi piđó bhi chap Ama. Ngaai kah bhi chap Akóón nek kah bhi chap Ama, nek Yaang ơi kayua Akóón. <verse eid="JHN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />Alua, alua, aku praaq palơq nôôq pe, ađek nek ngaai xâng paraaq aku lơq huuiq Yaang kayua aku nek bâân parmông taluôn luôn, lơq manưih achêk yươq vôôiq tơk leq rau praaq xêi, bơơi ơi jalơh tââq kan chêt đóng tơk parmông. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Alua, alua, aku praaq palơq nôôq pe kơi nek jơ ravang tơk, lơq bhêêl achêk nek xók đu manưih chêt e xâng dhariêng ưng Akóón Yaang Pleng, lơq nôôq ngaai xâng e mamông. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Taai Ama ve parmông kalóóng Ađó n'đó kơi, nek Ama kung đóng leq Akóón đóng ve parmông kalóóng Akóón kơi achêk, <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />lơq Ama ơi đóng leq Akóón mataai têêng rau praaq xêi taai Akóón nek Akóón Manưih. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Óóq chrih lêi leq rau ađô, ơi e tơk jơ đu mót bhêêl ađek, dyóp ngaai kalóóng ping xaal e xâng dhariêng ưng Ađó <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />lơq piđó e gluh leq nguôi — nôôq ngaai ơi têêng rau liêm nek malóóm tơk rau mamông lóóiq đóng parmông, dyơq nôôq đu ơi têêng rau aak nek malóóm tơk rau mamông lóóiq đóng leq rau xêi xanêi.<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Aku kah chóóm ganương dhiq ađêi kala đóng têêng dhơ dharau tarnêêng. Aku xêi xanêi ting kơi aku xâng, lơq rau xêi xanêi ưng aku nek bhơt liêm taai aku kah tabâân karnóq kiêng lalei ưng ađêi, bơơi nek karnóq kiêng ưng Yaang kayua ađêi. <verse eid="JHN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />La aku tư truuih đuui leq ađêi, nek paraaq truuih ưng aku nek kah đaang huuiq. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Ve mưi chanak lââng, nek manưih truuih đuui leq aku, lơq aku n'nal kơi paraaq truuih đu manưih ađek móón lalua leq aku nek alua dhalam. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Nôôq pe ơi kayua manưih vôôiq lum Jang, lơq Jang ơi truuih đuui đóng rau lalua. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Dhơ aku kah đơơp paraaq truuih tââq akóón manưih, bơơi aku praaq nôôq rau ađô nek đóng nôôq pe ve chóóm bâân paq. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Jang biêh nek par-aang dhơu dyơq róh lơq dyóól brương, dyơq nôôq pe ơi kiêng bhuui sương dhiq taklaaq brương ưng ađó achêk kalóóng mưi ganah. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Bơơi aku ve paraaq truuih gamak lơh paraaq truuih ưng Jang: achêk nek nôôq tarnêêng đu Ama ơi pajaau leq aku đóng aku têêng padyóp piđó — chênh nek nôôq tarnêêng đu aku têêng — truuih đuui leq aku kơi Ama ơi kayua aku. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Chênh Ama, Yaang kayua aku ơi truuih đuui leq aku. Nôôq pe kah ơi machu machâ xâng dhariêng Ađó, kung kah ơi móng lêi dyaang a-ô Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />Nôôq pe kah ve paraaq Ađó tơơt taluôn kalóóng ađêi, taai Yaang đu Ađó ơi kayua, nek nôôq pe kah ve lóóm huuiq dhiq Yaang achêk. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Nôôq pe chamet lêi Bha-aar Yaang Pleng, taai nôôq pe ngóq đươi ađek nek ve parmông taluôn luôn, lơq nôôq paraaq ađek nek nôôq paraaq truuih đuui leq aku, <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />lơq nôôq pe kah kiêng tơk palơq aku đóng ve bâân parmông. <verse eid="JHN 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />Aku kah pei đơơp cha-iil tabah tư tââq akóón manưih, <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />dhơ kơi ađek, aku n'nal leq nôôq pe kơi lóóm nh'nhơr Yaang Pleng kah ve kalóóng nôôq pe. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Aku ơi bhral kalóóng dhanóók Ama aku, lơq nôôq pe kah pơh đơơp aku. Bơơi la ngaai lââng bhral palơq dhanóók lalei ưng ađêi, nek nôôq pe pơh đơơp manưih ađek. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Ng'kơi têêng nôôq pe ve chóóm huuiq, xók dyơq pei jư cha-iil tabah tââq manưih lââng lơq kah chik chêk cha-iil tabah bhral tââq Yaang Pleng mưi giêl? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Óóq kanóq kơi chênh aku e patu nôôq pe toom mat Ama. Manưih patu nôôq pe nek Môôi-se, manưih đu nôôq pe tabóq lóóm rââm tââq ađó. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Taai la nôôq pe huuiq Môôi-se, hơq nôôq pe alua nek huuiq aku, achêk nek taai ađó achêk ơi xaraq leq aku. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Bơơi la nôôq pe kah huuiq nôôq paraaq xar karvech ưng ađó achêk, nek ng'kơi têêng hơq nôôq pe e huuiq paraaq aku?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Lơh nôôq tarnêêng ađek, Chuôq Jê-su yuur vôôiq kalơng chaang tóór hót tôôh ưng Taxiiq Ga-li-lê, (nek parah Ti-bê-ri-aat). <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Mưi tanóói dhanuôr bơk bhlơng vôôiq ting Ađó, taai piđó ơi biêh bâân lêi nôôq raman chrih đu Ađó têêng dhiq nôôq manưih ka-ai dhuôr. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Xók achêk, Chuôq Jê-su yuur đơk leq kakóóng, lơq dhiq ađek Ađó joon tơơt nek palơq nôôq môôn-đô ưng Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />(Xók achêk, Bhiêk Jalơh, ganah bhiêk ưng manưih Jo Thaaiq, ơi đan tơk.) <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Xong ađek, xók angơơq mat yuur lơq lêi kơi dhanuôr manưih bơk bhlơng dyơq pajươk vôôiq leq ađêi, Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq Phi-liip: “Nôôq he ve chóóm kơl beng n'tââq đóng nôôq manưih ađô cha?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />(Bơơi Ađó tamóh kơi ađek đóng klêêu Phi-liip, taai Ađó ơi n'nal rau ađêi ravang têêng.) <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Phi-liip ââi bóóp Ađó: “Bơơr hariêng đơ-ni-ê beng kah dyóp đóng piđó buôn mưi chanak ve chóóm đơơp m'bưưiq m'bưưiq.” <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />En-rê, mưi kalóóng nôôq môôn-đô Ađó, adhi padruuih ưng Si-môôn Phi-e-rơ, móón palơq Ađó: <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Dhiq ađôk ve mưi paniên padruuih hơq ađó ađek ve xââng beq beng aviq met lơq bơơr panong kadhóóng, bơơi nôôq rau ađô ve nek leq tơk praang marchơng palơq sôôq manưih kuôq bơk?” <verse eid="JHN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq: “Nek ralap rapaq đóng palââng tơơt chok leq.” (Xók chêk ve bơk bhơơi chat dhiq ađek.) Kơi chêk, nôôq padruuih tơơt chok leq, parbơk mơ xââng ngaan. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Tââq ađek Chuôq Jê-su kadhâng nôôq beq beng lơq xong xók tapôông paraaq ma-ơ, Ađó nh'xóóng đóng leq nôôq manưih dyơq tơơt cha, lơq kung têêng kơi ađek palơq kadhóóng, mak mơ palââng kiêng. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Hayơq xók dhanuôr manưih ơi kabhôôq kajrê, Ađó yua nôôq môôn-đô ađêi: “Phaai chêk karong nôôq beng lêêk dyơq xưa, đóng kah ve dha rau bâân m'peq pahư.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Kơi ađek piđó chêk karong lơq chrooq bing majêt bơơr jong beng lêêk dyơq xưa lóóiq tââq xââng beq beng aviq met, đu dhanuôr manưih ơi cha. <verse eid="JHN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Taai ađek, nôôq manưih đương lêi raman chrih Ađó ơi têêng, móón kơi ađô: “Ađô dhalam nek manưih đââng taruuih phaai bhral kalóóng hóng katiêk.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Kơi ađek, ơi đâh n'nal kơi piđó kanóq tơk lơq pa-eep ađêi đóng padyók yuur têêng bhua, hơq Chuôq Jê-su róch lóóiq đơk leq kakóóng mưi ađêi.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Xók chêk, bhêêl pleng ravang blót, nôôq môôn-đô Ađó dhuônh leq taxiiq, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />hayơq xók ơi dyók leq bhuông, piđó vôôiq chaang hót tôôh taxiiq malóóm leq Ka-bê-na-um, lơq pleng ơi val vaaih kanam kanheet aq, hơq Chuôq Jê-su kung kah tơk leq piđó. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Taai mưi garnhuh adhiiq karơ pruung lalơh, hơq taxiiq yuur gar-uul. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Xók ơi avơq đuôh mơ bơơr jêt xââng môôiq pe jêt êch-ta-đơ, nôôq môôn-đô lêi Chuôq Jê-su vôôiq dyung piing taxiiq lơq tơk đan bhuông, hơq piđó bâân kakhin kapơn. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Bơơi Ađó móón piđó: “Nek thêi nô! Óóq kakhin.” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Kơi ađek hơq, piđó kiêng tơq Ađó dyók leq bhuông, nek n'drươh bhuông tơk leq tóór, dhiq piđó kiêng vôôiq tơk.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Tangêi tatun, manưih ganơr biêh bhiêk tơơt tóór taxiiq hót ađek lêi kơi nguôi tââq mưi beq bhuông hơq kah ve m'beq bhuông đu lââng dhiq ađek, lơq lêi kơi Chuôq Jê-su ơi kah mót kalóóng m'beq bhuông palơq nôôq môôn-đô Ađó, hơq chapiên ve nôôq môôn-đô Ađó yuur vôôiq. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Dhơ kơi ađek, nôôq bhuông lââng ơi bhral tââq Ti-bê-ri-aat đan dhiq đu piđó ơi cha beng xong xók Chuôq ơi ma-ơơn. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Taai kơi ađek, xók ganơr manưih lêi kơi Chuôq Jê-su kah tơơt dhiq ađek, nôôq môôn-đô Ađó kung kah, nek piđó dyók leq bhuông lơq vôôiq tơk Ka-bê-na-um chik chêk Chuôq Jê-su. <verse eid="JHN 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Xong xók bâân lêi Ađó hót tóór tôôh taxiiq, piđó tamóh Jê-su: “Ra-bi, thêi tơk leq ađô n'đó bhêêl?” <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi bóóp piđó lơq Ađó praaq: “Alua, alua, aku praaq palơq adhi anó, adhi anó chêk aku eh rau taai adhi anó ơi bâân lêi nôôq raman chrih, bơơi taai adhi anó ơi cha beng lơq bâân kabhôôq kajrê. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Óóq têêng tarnêêng taai chana pardyơk buôn ma-ih, bơơi taai chana pardyơk dyơq lóóiq tơk parmông taluôn luôn đu Akóón Manưih e đóng leq adhi anó, taai Yaang Pleng, nek Ama, ơi tabóq kanal dhiq Ađó.” <verse eid="JHN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Kơi achêk hayơq piđó móón palơq Ađó: “Hau rau nôôq yi kơng têêng đóng nôôq yi ve chóóm têêng tarnêêng ưng Yaang Pleng?” <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi bóóp lơq Ađó kayua piđó: “Ađôk nek tarnêêng ưng Yaang Pleng, achêk nek adhi anó tabóq lóóm huuiq ganơơm dhiq Yaang đu Ađó ơi kayua bhral.” <verse eid="JHN 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Kơi ađek, piđó móón palơq Ađó: “Kơi achêk nek thêi têêng mataai chrih n'đó đóng nôôq yi lêi lơq huuiq thêi? Thêi têêng harau tarnêêng? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Abhươp avuôq ưng nôôq yi cha ma-na kalóóng kruung vơng, kơi ve xaraq kơi ađô: ‘Ađó đóng leq piđó beng tââq pleng đóng cha.’” <verse eid="JHN 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Hayơq Chuôq Jê-su ââi lóóiq piđó: “Alua, alua, aku praaq palơq adhi anó, Môôi-se kah glêh đóng leq adhi anó beng tââq pleng, bơơi Ama aku đóng leq adhi anó beng alua tââq pleng. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Taai beng ưng Yaang Pleng nek beng dhaluônh tââq pleng lơq đóng parmông leq hóng katiêk.” <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Kơi ađek hơq, piđó móón palơq Ađó: “Thêi ơơi, nhan đóng leq nôôq yi beng achêk taluôn luôn.” <verse eid="JHN 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “Aku nek beng ưng parmông, ngaai tơk leq aku dhakơi e yươq ha-ul, lơq ngaai huuiq ganơơm dhiq aku dhakơi e kah ve mơ rahaal. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Bơơi aku ơi móón adhi anó kơi adhi anó ơi lêi aku hơq adhi anó kah huuiq. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Tabhơt nôôq ngaai đu Ama đóng leq aku e tơk palơq aku, lơq manưih tơk palơq aku, hơq aku alua dhakơi e kah lơơi leq nguôi. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Taai aku tââq pleng dhaluônh eh rau đóng aku têêng ting karnóq ưng ađêi, bơơi ting karnóq ưng Yaang kayua aku. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Bơơi ađôk nek karnóq kiêng ưng Yaang kayua aku, achêk nek aku kah lơơi bil manak manâ kalóóng tabhơt nôôq manưih đu Ama ơi đóng leq aku, bơơi aku e têêng manưih ađek mamông lóóiq leq tangêi xariêq parlưch. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Taai ađôk nek karnóq kiêng ưng Ama aku, kơi dhơ dhangaai lêi Akóón lơq huuiq leq Akóón nek ve bâân parmông taluôn luôn, dyơq aku e têêng manưih ađek mamông lóóiq leq tangêi xariêq parlưch.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Kơi achêk hayơq, manưih Jo Thaaiq m'bhoonh leq Ađó taai Ađó praaq: “Aku nek beng dhuônh tââq pleng.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Piđó móón: “Kah alua ađô nek Jê-su, akóón padruuih ưng Jô-seep đu nôôq he n'nal drêh ama lơq amêêq ưng ađó achêk? Kơi achêk hau xók đôk ađó móón kơi ađô: ‘Aku dhuônh tââq pleng’?” <verse eid="JHN 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi bóóp lơq móón piđó: “Nek óóq m'bhoonh palơq xóng ađêi dyơq. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Kah ngaai ve chóóm tơk palơq aku la Ama, Yaang kayua aku, kah kađââng manưih achêk tơk, dyơq aku e têêng manưih achêk mamông lóóiq leq tangêi xariêq palưch. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Ađek nek rau bâân xaraq kalóóng nôôq bha-aar manưih đââng taruuih: ‘Hayơq tabhơt e bâân Yaang Pleng pachóóm.’ Dhơ dhangaai ơi xâng lơq ơi hok tââq Ama hayơq tơk palơq Aku. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Ơi taai kah manak manâ glêh lêi Ama, nguôi tââq Yaang tơơt kalóóng xók ve mat ưng Yaang Pleng — Ađó ơi lêi Ama. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Alua, alua, Aku praaq palơq adhi anó, ngaai đu huuiq nek bâân parmông taluôn luôn. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Aku nek beng ưng parmông. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Abhươp avuôq ưng adhi anó ơi cha ma-na kalóóng kruung vơng, hayơq piđó chêt. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Ađôk nek beng tââq pleng dhuônh, nek đóng tư tââq beng achêk ngaai cha nek yươq chêt. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Aku nek beng mamông tââq pleng dhuônh. La ngaai đu cha beng ađô, manưih achêk e mamông patơk taluôn luôn. Kơi lââng, achak Aku kung chênh nek beng đu Aku e đóng taai parmông ưng hóng katiêk.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Kơi achêk nek manưih Jo Thaaiq tarkaai palơq xóng piđó, kơi ađô: “Ng'kơi têêng manưih ađô ve chóóm đóng nôôq he đah achak ưng ađó?” <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Kơi achêk hơq, Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “Alua, alua Aku praaq palơq adhi anó, la adhi anó kah đah achak Akóón Manưih lơq ơm ahaam ưng Ađó, nek adhi anó e kah ve parmông kalóóng ađêi. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Ngaai đu đah achak Aku lơq ơm ahaam Aku, hơq ve parmông taluôn luôn, dyơq Aku e têêng manưih ađek mamông lóóiq mót tangêi xariêq palưch. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Taai achak Aku nek chana padyơk lalua, lơq ahaam Aku nek đơơk ơm lalua. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Ngaai đah achak Aku lơq ơm ahaam Aku nek bhiêk tơơt kalóóng Aku, lơq Aku kung tơơt kalóóng manưih ađek. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Kơi Ama taluôn mamông ơi kayua Aku, dyơq Aku mamông ganơơm Ama n'đó kơi, nek manưih đah achak Aku e kung mamông ganơơm Aku kơi achêk. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Ađôk nek beng tââq pleng dhuônh, eh rau kơi beng nôôq abhươp avuôq ơi cha hayơq chêt. Ngaai đu cha beng ađô e mamông patơk taluôn luôn.” <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Ađó praaq nôôq paraaq achêk kalóóng đong gươl, xók truuih pachóóm dhiq Ka-bê-na-um.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Kơi achêk hayơq, xók bơk manưih kalóóng sôôq nôôq môôn-đô ưng Ađó xâng kơi ađek, piđó móón: “Paraaq ađô alua nek kadhaap, ngaai đu ve đuôh chóóm xâng ađó?” <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Bơơi taai Chuôq Jê-su tư n'nal kơi nôôq môôn-đô Ađêi dyơq m'bhoonh leq rau achêk. Ađó móón piđó: “Paraaq ađek praaq tamôôp adhi anó kơi? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Kơi ađek la adhi anó lêi Akóón Manưih đơk dhiq Ađó tơơt n'loom hei nek ng'kơi? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Yaang Liêm nek Yaang têêng đóng mamông; manưih ti kah rau malơơi malaai. Nôôq paraaq đu thêi ơi praaq palơq adhi anó nek yaang lóóm, lơq piđó nek parmông. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Kơi achêk bơơi kalóóng nôôq adhi anó ve bơơr pe ngaai kah huuiq.” Taai Chuôq Jê-su ơi n'nal tââq tarnââp ngaai nek đu kah huuiq, lơq ngaai nek đu e palâh tamôôp Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Lơq Ađó praaq: “Taai rau ađek, thêi ơi praaq palơq adhi anó kơi kah manak manâ ve chóóm tơk palơq thêi la ơơn phươk kah bâân Ama đóng leq manưih achêk.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Tââq bhêêl achêk, bơk manưih kalóóng sôôq nôôq môôn-đô Ađó palâh jađaang val chô lơq kah dyơq vôôiq mandrươh palơq Ađó dyơq. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Taai ađek, Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq majêt bơơr sưưq-đô: “Kah hayang adhi anó kung kiêng yuur xooq?” <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Si-môôn Phi-e-rơ ââi bóóp Ađó: “Kakoh Chuôq, nôôq yi e vôôiq ting ngaai? Amei ve nôôq paraaq ưng parmông taluôn luôn, <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />nôôq yi huuiq lơq đơơp n'nal kơi Amei nek Yaang Tabah ưng Yaang Pleng.” <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi lóóiq piđó: “Kah lua thêi ơi chââih adhi anó, nek majêt bơơr sưưq-đô, hơq mưi chanak kalóóng adhi anó nek abhưi.” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Ađó praaq leq Ju-đa akóón padruuih ưng Si-môôn Ich-ka-ri-ôôt, taai chênh ađó, mưi kalóóng majêt bơơr chanak, ravang palâh jơl Ađó.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Lơh nôôq tarnêêng ađek, Chuôq Jê-su vôôiq leq ađô leq tôôh kalóóng xưưq Ga-li-lê, taai Ađó kah ve kanóq vôôiq tơk Ju-đê taai manưih Jo Thaaiq dyơq tabâân kơi leng Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Xók achêk, Bhiêk Pơơq Pađơ, mưi ganah bhiêk ưng manưih Jo Thaaiq, ơi tơk đan. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Kơi ađek, nôôq adhi padruuih Ađó móón palơq Ađó: “Phaai xooq tââq đôk lơq vôôiq tơk Ju-đê, đóng nôôq môôn-đô ưng amei e kung lêi nôôq tarnêêng ưng amei đu amei chóóm têêng. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Taai kah ngaai têêng mưi raurâ ađek kalóóng lalââp hơq tư chêk ađêi kala tơơt dhiq dham baang aang. La amei chóóm têêng nôôq tarnêêng kơi ađô, nek pakah amei kala đóng tabhơt hóng katiêk”. <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Ơi patơk nôôq adhi Ađó kung kah ve lóóm huuiq dhiq Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Taai kơi ađek, Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “Jơ ưng aku kung kah ơi tơk, bơơi jơ ưng nôôq pe nek dyóp bhêêl kung ravang lơơi. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Manưih hóng katiêk yươq chóóm chróót geet nôôq adhi, bơơi manưih hóng katiêk chróót geet aku, taai aku truuih móón leq manưih hóng katiêk kơi nôôq tarnêêng têêng ưng piđó nek lơt aak. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Nôôq adhi phaai vôôiq đơk pơh bhiêk; aku biêh kah ơi vôôiq pơh bhiêk ađô taai jơ ưng aku kah ơi chóóm dyóp.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Xók achêk, xók xong praaq kơi ađek palơq piđó, Ađó bhiêk tơơt dhiq Ga-li-lê.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Dhơ kơi ađek, xók nôôq adhi Ađó vôôiq đơk pơh bhiêk, hơq bhêêl achêk Ađó kung vôôiq, bơơi nek ting kơi lalââp, kah pakah. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Taai kơi achêk, manưih Jo Thaaiq chik chêk Ađó kalóóng ganah bhiêk, lơq praaq: “N'dhiq Ađó ađek tơơt?” <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Ve bơk manưih dhiq m'pơng dhanuôr manưih m'bhoonh leq Ađó. Bơk manưih móón kơi ađô: “Ađó achêk nek manưih liêm.” Palâh lóóiq masôôq lââng móón: “Eh rau, bơơi, Ađó chêk keh kađââng dhanuôr manưih vôôiq lơt xraang.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Dhơ kơi ađek, kah ngaai praaq kơi rathaai pakah leq Ađó taai kamrôôn kakhin manưih Jo Thaaiq.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Xók achêk, mót bhêêl m'pơng ganah bhiêk ơi, Chuôq Jê-su vôôiq leq đong bhanuôih lơq truuih pachóóm. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Kơi achêk nek manưih Jo Thaaiq lóng chrih lêi xók praaq: “Ng'kơi têêng manưih ađô dyóp n'nal nôôq paraaq ma-um mayaang achêk, dhơ kah hok đuui dhiq đong parhok?” <verse eid="JHN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Kơi achêk hayơq, Chuôq Jê-su ââi bóóp piđó, lơq Ađó praaq: “Paraaq pachóóm ưng aku eh rau nek ưng aku, bơơi nek ưng Yaang kayua aku. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />La ngaai đu rahaal ra-ơh têêng ting karnóq kiêng Ađó, manưih achêk e n'nal leq paraaq pachóóm ađô ve alua nek bhral tââq Yaang Pleng môôiq nek tââq tư aku yuur praaq. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Ngaai đu tââq chênh ađêi hayơq praaq, ađó achêk tabâân gavơh cha-iil tabah đóng mơ ađêi, bơơi manưih tabâân cha-iil tabah ưng Yaang kayua ađêi ađek nek manưih liêm dhalam, lơq kah ve rau kah liêm tơơt kalóóng manưih achêk. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Eh dhơq Môôi-se ơi đóng gani leq nôôq pe? Hơq kah ngaai kalóóng nôôq pe xâng jư gani. Kơi nôôq pe val tabâân kơi đóng leng aku?” <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Dhanuôr manưih ââi lóóiq: “Amei pâng abhưi bóq aq! Ngaai kiêng leng Amei?” <verse eid="JHN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi bóóp, lơq Ađó móón piđó: “Aku ơi têêng mưi tarnêêng, lơq tabhơt nôôq pe maar chrih lêi. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Taai rau ađô, Môôi-se ơi đóng pheep iêt ng'kar leq nôôq pe (eh rau pheep ađek ve tââq Môôi-se, bơơi nek tââq nôôq abhươp avuôq), lơq nôôq pe têêng iêt ng'kar đóng manưih padruuih kalóóng tangêi Sa-baat. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />La mưi nak đơơp pheep iêt ng'kar mót tangêi Sa-baat đóng yươq têêng lơt gani Môôi-se, kơi nôôq pe val yuur pagrâ palơq aku taai aku têêng đóng mưi nak bâân yươh khe karơ mót tangêi Sa-baat? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Óóq xêi xanêi ting kơi hót nguôi, bơơi phaai xêi xanêi palơq đơơp n'nal bhơt liêm.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Dharing ađek, nôôq manưih kalóóng dhanuôr Jê-ru-sa-leem móón kơi ađô: “Eh dhơq ađôk nek manưih đu palââng dyơq tabâân đóng leng kah lua? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Tôôh, Ađó achêk praaq kơi rathaai pakah hơq palââng kah rau móón palơq Ađó ađek. Ve kơq kabhuh têêng gamak alua đơơp n'nal kơi manưih ađô nek Chuôq Paq Manưih? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Dhơ kơi ađek, nôôq he ơi n'nal manưih ađô gluh n'đó tââq. Bơơi xók Chuôq Paq Manưih bhral, kah ngaai n'nal n'tââq Ađó bhral.” <verse eid="JHN 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Xong ađek, kalóóng đong bhanuôih, Chuôq Jê-su truuih pachóóm karơ dhariêng lơq praaq: “Nôôq pe tame n'nal aku, tame n'nal aku gluh n'đó tââq. Aku kah tư ađêi bhral, bơơi Yaang kayua aku nek dhalam lalua, nek Yaang đu nôôq pe kah n'nal. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Aku n'nal Ađó taai aku gluh tââq Ađó, lơq Ađó ơi kayua aku.” <verse eid="JHN 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Kơi achêk hơq, piđó tabâân kóóp Ađó, hơq kah ngaai khin paglêh têi dhiq Ađó taai jơ Ađó kah ơi tơk. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Dhơ kơi ađek, bơk manưih kalóóng dhanuôr tabóq lóóm huuiq dhiq Ađó lơq piđó móón: “Xók Chuôq Paq Manưih bhral, kah kơq Ađó e têêng bơk karnal chrih lơh nôôq rau manưih ađô ơi têêng?” <verse eid="JHN 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Manưih Pha-ri-si xâng dhanuôr manưih dhaxi dhaxó nôôq paraaq ađô leq Chuôq Jê-su, nek nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm palơq manưih Pha-ri-si kayua nôôq linh jư vôôiq đóng piđó kóóp Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Kơi ađek hơq, Chuôq Jê-su praaq: “Aku tơơt kơơq palơq nôôq pe mưi ganah gađóq dyơq, hayơq aku vôôiq tơk Yaang kayua aku. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Nôôq pe e chêk aku bơơi nôôq pe e kah lum aku, lơq dhiq aku tơơt nôôq pe kah kơi tơk chóóm.” <verse eid="JHN 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Taai kơi ađek, manưih Jo Thaaiq tamóh xóng piđó: “Manưih ađô kanóq ravang vôôiq leq hơq nôôq he e kah bâân lêi ađó ađek? Ve kơq ađó ađek kanóq ravang vôôiq palơq dhanuôr xraang xruk kalóóng kabhuh manưih Hi-laap hayơq pachóóm đóng dhanuôr Hi-laap? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Paraaq ađô hau kiêng móón hơq ađó ađek ơi praaq: ‘Nôôq pe e chêk aku bơơi nôôq pe e kah lum, lơq dhiq aku tơơt nôôq pe kah kơi tơk chóóm’?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Bơơi hayơq, mót tangêi xariêq, nek tangêi bhơt gamak kalóóng ganah bhiêk, Chuôq Jê-su yuur dyương hayơq karơ dhariêng praaq kơi ađô: “La ngaai rahaal phaai tơk palơq aku lơq ơm. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Ngaai đu huuiq dhiq aku, nek dhiêp kơi Bha-aar Yaang Pleng truuih: ‘Karuung đơơk taluôn mamông e yuur hóói jahuk tââq lóóm ađêi.’” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Xók achêk, Ađó praaq rau ađô leq Yaang Liêm, Yaang đu nôôq ngaai huuiq dhiq Ađó ravang bâân đơơp; taai Yaang Liêm kah ơi bhral taai Chuôq Jê-su biêh kah ơi bâân bhi haanh. <verse eid="JHN 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Dharing ađek, xók xâng nôôq paraaq achêk, nôôq manưih kalóóng dhanuôr manưih móón: “Manưih ađô lalua dhalam nek manưih đââng taruuih.” <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Masôôq lââng móón: “Manưih ađô nek Chuôq Paq Manưih.” Bơơi masôôq móón: “Praaq padrêh, ve kơq Chuôq Paq Manưih gluh tââq Ga-li-lê? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Kah alua Bha-aar Yaang Pleng truuih kơi Chuôq Paq Manưih e gluh tââq dhong nooi Đa-viit, lơq gluh tââq Bêêt-lê-heem, nek kanóón đu Đa-viit ơi mamông?” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Taai kơi ađek, rau tatech tablah yuur vaaih kalóóng dhanuôr manưih ơi taai Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Xók achêk, bơơr pe nak kalóóng kabhuh piđó kiêng kóóp Ađó, bơơi kah ngaai paglêh têi dhiq Ađó khin.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Xong ađek, nôôq đương jư val chô lum nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm lơq manưih Pha-ri-si, nôôq manưih achêk tamóh piđó: “Taai kơi nôôq pe kah đââng ađó ađek chô?” <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Nôôq đương jư ââi: “Kah glêh ve ngaai truuih pachóóm kơi manưih ađô.” <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Kơi achêk nek, nôôq manưih Pha-ri-si ââi lóóiq piđó: “Ve kơq nôôq pe kung bâân galơơk galơm óh? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Mơq ve ngaai kalóóng kabhuh têêng gamak môôiq kalóóng kabhuh manưih Pha-ri-si huuiq dhiq ađó ađek? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Dhơ kơi ađek, ganơr dhanuôr kah n'nal gani ađô, kabhuh piđó alua đaang ngi tóh!” <verse eid="JHN 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Ni-kô-đeem (manưih glêh tơk lum Ađó laloom hei, nek mưi manưih mađó leq kabhuh ađek) móón palơq piđó: <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Gani ưng nôôq he kah đóng xêi xanêi mưi nak panâ, nguôi tââq laloom tââm tameng xâng tââq manưih achêk lơq n'nal manưih achêk têêng harau dhơơm, pâng kah?” <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Piđó ââi lóóiq, lơq praaq palơq ađó: “Ve kơq amei kung mađó leq dhanuôr Ga-li-lê? Phaai kanóq xâng lơq chamet lêi, kơi kah ve n'đó manưih đââng taruuih bâân yuur vaaih tââq Ga-li-lê.”<verse eid="JHN 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />(Hayơq dyóp ngaai chô leq đong ađêi.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Xók achêk, Chuôq Jê-su bhađơk leq kakóóng Ô-liiu. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Bơơi mót bhêêl yayóng jarương, Ađó vôôiq lóóiq tơk đong bhanuôih, lơq dyóp ngaai pajươk tơk paleq Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Xók achêk, nôôq thêi pachóóm gani lơq nôôq manưih Pha-ri-si đââng tơk mưi pađiil parkan bâân lum kóóp xók tarlum têêng tapiing, hayơq palââng lơơi ađó tơơt pa-ô dhiq m'pơng. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Taai klêêu Ađó, nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih móón palơq Ađó đóng piđó ve paraaq kaauq patu jaklâk lóóiq Ađó: “Thêi ơơi, manưih pađiil parkan ađô bâân takóóp talum nek palơq tarnêêng têêng matu tapiing. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Kơi lââng, kalóóng gani, Môôi-se ơi truuih phaai glơm dhơl nôôq manưih kơi ađek, dyơq xók đôk, Thêi praaq ng'kơi?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Bơơi xong xók kóp chok leq, Chuôq Jê-su xaraq dhiq katiêk palơq chabô têi ađêi. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Kalóóng bhêêl ađek, piđó bhiêk gluh pakah tamóh ng'ngơng, Ađó ngơơq chaling lơq móón piđó: “Ngaai kalóóng nôôq pe yươq ve matu lơt, nek glơm dhơl leq ađó ađô laloom tââm.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Hayơq kóp chok leq, Ađó lóóiq xaraq dhiq katiêk palơq chabô têi ađêi. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Bơơi hayơq, ting chanak mưi kalóóng nôôq manưih Jo Thaaiq achêk yuur xooq, tââp tanââp palơq nôôq manưih taha tuôi tââm, tơk mơ tabhơt piđó maar yuur róch, lơq chapiên nek mưi Ađó dyơq lóóiq, nek palơq manưih pađiil parkan dyơq tơơt pa-ô m'pơng. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Kơi achêk hơq, xong xók ngơơq chaling Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq manưih pađiil parkan achêk: “Kabhuh piđó tơơt n'dhiq? Kah ngaai patu amei hơ?” <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Lơq ađó ââi: “Kah ve ngaai, Chuôq ơơi.” Hayơq Chuôq Jê-su praaq: “Aku kung kah patu amei. Amei phaai vôôiq, tââq đôk óóq têêng matu dyơq.”)<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Xong ađek, Chuôq Jê-su vil praaq palơq piđó kơi ađô: “Aku nek taklaaq brương ưng hóng katiêk, ngaai đu ting Aku alua dhakơi e kah jađaang vôôiq kalóóng bóng kanam, bơơi ve taklaaq brương ưng parmông.” <verse eid="JHN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Xong ađek, nôôq manưih Pha-ri-si móón palơq Ađó: “Thêi truuih đuui leq chênh Ađêi nek paraaq truuih ưng Thêi nek kah chóóm huuiq.” <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi lóóiq lơq Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Dhơ nek aku truuih đuui leq chênh ađêi, paraaq truuih đuui ưng aku nek chóóm huuiq. Taai aku n'nal aku n'đó tââq bhral lơq aku ravang vôôiq n'leq, dyơq nôôq pe kah n'nal aku bhral n'tââq môôiq aku ravang n'đó leq vôôiq. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Nôôq pe xêi lơt ting karnóq manưih; Aku kah xêi lơt dhơ dhangaai. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Bơơi patơk la kơi aku xêi lơt, nek rau xêi lơt ưng aku nek dhalam tapat taai aku kah tơơt mưi ađêi, bơơi aku nek palơq Ama, nek Yaang đu kayua aku. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Kơi lââng, kalóóng gani ưng nôôq pe ve xaraq kơi paraaq truuih đuui ưng bơơr chanak nek chóóm huuiq. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Aku nek manưih truuih đuui leq chênh ađêi, lơq Ama, nek Yaang đu kayua aku, truuih đuui leq aku.” <verse eid="JHN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Kơi achêk hơq, piđó móón palơq Ađó: “Ama ưng thêi tơơt n'dhiq?” Chuôq Jê-su ââi bóóp: “Nôôq pe kah n'nal aku, kung kah n'nal Ama aku; la nôôq pe ơi n'nal aku, hơq alua nek nôôq pe kung n'nal Ama aku.” <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Ađó praaq nôôq paraaq ađô dhiq kađôôq lơơi jêên pagoop, xók bhêêl truuih pachóóm kalóóng đong bhanuôih, bơơi kah ngaai kóóp jư Ađó taai jơ ưng Ađó kah tơk.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Xong ađek, Ađó vil praaq palơq piđó: “Aku yuur vôôiq, lơq nôôq pe e chêk aku, hayơq nôôq pe e chêt kalóóng matu lơt ađêi. Leq aku vôôiq, nôôq pe kah kơi tơk chóóm.” <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Kơi Achêk nek manưih Jo Thaaiq móón: “Ve kơq manưih ađô e leng ađêi kala, taai ađó ađek móón: ‘Leq aku vôôiq nôôq pe kah kơi tơk chóóm’?” <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Lơq Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Nôôq pe gluh tââq hót raal, aku gluh tââq piing yaal. Nôôq pe mađó leq hóng katiêk ađô, Aku kah mađó leq hóng katiêk ađô. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Taai ađek, Aku praaq palơq nôôq pe kơi nôôq pe e chêt kalóóng matu lơt ađêi. Taai la nôôq pe kah huuiq kơi aku alua kơi ađek, nek nôôq pe e chêt kalóóng matu lơt ađêi.” <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Taai kơi ađek, piđó móón palơq Ađó: “Thêi nek ngaai?” Chuôq Jê-su móón piđó: “Hau rau đu Aku patơk mơ ơi praaq palơq nôôq pe tư tââq tarnââp. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Aku ve bơk rau đóng praaq lơq đóng xêi xanêi leq nôôq pe. Dhơ kơi ađek, Yaang đu kayua aku nek dhalam lalua; kơi ađek nôôq rau aku xâng tââq Ađó nek aku praaq nôôq rau achêk đóng manưih hóng katiêk.” <verse eid="JHN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Piđó kah n'nal kơi Ađó dyơq praaq leq Ama đóng piđó. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Kơi achêk hayơq, Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “Xók nôôq pe yuur yông Akóón Manưih, nek bhêêl achêk, nôôq pe e n'nal kơi aku alua kơi ađek, lơq aku kah tư ađêi têêng hau rau. Palâh lóóiq, aku praaq nôôq rau ađô ting kơi Ama ơi pachóóm aku. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Yaang đu kayua aku tơơt palơq aku; Ađó yươq lơơi aku laleh dharit, taai aku taluôn têêng rau liêm lóóm Ađó.” <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Xók bhêêl Ađó dyơq pachóóm nôôq paraaq achêk, bơk manưih tabóq lóóm huuiq dhiq Ađó.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Hayơq Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq nôôq manưih Jo Thaaiq ơi huuiq Ađó: “La nôôq pe bhiêk tơơt kalóóng paraaq ưng aku, nôôq pe alua nek môôn-đô ưng Aku; <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />nôôq pe e n'nal paraaq dhalam, lơq paraaq dhalam e paloh nôôq pe.” <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Piđó chróót ââi palơq Ađó: “Nôôq yi nek akóón chachau Ap-ra-haam lơq yươq glêh têêng xól đóng dhơ dhangaai; ng'kơi thêi móón kơi ađô: ‘Nôôq pe e bâân rathaai’?” <verse eid="JHN 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi bóóp piđó: “Alua, alua, aku praaq palơq nôôq pe, kơi ngaai đu têêng matu hayơq nek têêng dhơn xól ưng matu. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Kơi lââng, têêng dhơn xól kah bhiêk tơơt taluôn kalóóng đong, Akóón nek bhiêk tơơt taluôn luôn. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Taai kơi chêk, la Akóón paloh nôôq pe, nek nôôq pe e lalua bâân rathaai. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Aku n'nal kơi nôôq pe nek akóón chachau Ap-ra-haam, bơơi nôôq pe tabâân kơi leng aku taai paraaq aku kah ve dhiq kalóóng nôôq pe. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Aku praaq nôôq rau aku ơi lêi tââq Ama; Dyơq nôôq pe nek têêng nôôq tarnêêng nôôq pe xâng tââq ama ađêi.” <verse eid="JHN 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Piđó chróót ââi lơq praaq palơq Ađó: “Ama ưng nôôq yi nek Ap-ra-haam.” Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “Hơq la nôôq pe nek akóón chachau ưng Ap-ra-haam nek nôôq pe ơi têêng nôôq tarnêêng ưng Ap-ra-haam. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Bơơi xók ađôk, nôôq pe tabâân kơi leng aku, mưi chanak hơq ơi praaq đóng nôôq pe paraaq dhalam, nek rau aku xâng tââq Yaang Pleng. Ap-ra-haam ơi kah têêng rau kơi ađek. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Nôôq pe têêng nôôq tarnêêng ưng ama ađêi.” Kơi ađek hơq, piđó móón palơq Ađó: “Nôôq yi bâân yuur n'niên eh rau tââq rau têêng tapiing; nôôq yi ve mưi Ama, nek Yaang Pleng.” <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Chuôq Jê-su móón piđó: “Praaq babi Yaang Pleng nek Ama ưng nôôq pe, hơq alua nek nôôq pe ơi nh'nhơr aku, taai aku bhral tââq Yaang Pleng, lơq ve mat dhiq ađô; taai aku kah tư karnóq bhral, bơơi chênh Ađó ơi kayua aku. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Taai ng'kơi hơq nôôq pe kah n'nal galuh praaq chiên ađô ưng aku? Ađek nek taai nôôq pe kah ve đuôh chóóm xâng nôôq paraaq ưng aku. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Nôôq pe mađó leq ama ađêi, chênh nek abhưi, lơq nôôq pe ve lóóm têêng ting nôôq malóóch kiêng ưng ama ađêi. Tââq tarnââp ađó nek đu leng manưih lơq kah glêh dyương mưng kalóóng paraaq dhalam, taai kah ve paraaq dhalam kalóóng ađó. Xók ađó praaq paraaq galơơk chachââr, nek ađó praaq tââq lóóm kanóq ưng ađó taai ađó nek đu praaq chachââr lơq nek ama ưng rau praaq chachââr. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Bơơi taai aku praaq lalua, hơq nôôq pe kah huuiq aku. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Ngaai kalóóng nôôq pe chaleq pakah gluh aku ve matu? La aku praaq rau lalua, taai ng'kơi nôôq pe kah huuiq aku? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Ngaai đu mađó leq Yaang Pleng nek xâng paraaq ưng Yaang Pleng; taai rau ađek nôôq pe kah xâng ơi taai nôôq pe kah mađó leq Yaang Pleng.” <verse eid="JHN 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Manưih Jo Thaaiq ââi chróót lơq praaq palơq Ađó: “Nôôq yi kah praaq pâng, kơi amei nek makơi manưih Sa-ma-ri lơq bâân abhưi bóq?” <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi bóóp: “Aku yươq bâân abhưi bóq, palâh lóóiq, Aku bhi chap Ama aku; dyơq nôôq pe nek paxê tamôôp aku. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Kơi lââng, Aku kah chik chêk cha-iil tabah ưng ađêi; ve mưi Yaang chik chêk lơq xêi xanêi. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Alua, alua, Aku praaq palơq nôôq pe, la ngaai đu xâng jư paraaq Aku, nek manưih achêk alua dhakơi e yươq lêi kan chêt tơk taluôn luôn.” <verse eid="JHN 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Manưih Jo Thaaiq móón palơq Ađó: “Xók đôk nôôq yi ơi n'nal kơi Amei bâân abhưi bóq. Ap-ra-haam lơq nôôq manưih đââng taruuih ơi chêt, hơq Amei nek praaq: ‘La ngaai đu xâng jư paraaq Aku, manưih achêk alua dhakơi e yươq bâân xâng akan chêt tơk taluôn luôn.’ <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Ve kơq Amei nek gamak lơh abhươp avuôq Ap-ra-haam ưng nôôq yi, nek mưi chanak ơi chêt alua? Nôôq manưih đââng taruuih kung ơi chêt. Amei tư đóng ađêi nek ngaai?” <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi bóóp: “La aku tư bhi haanh ađêi, cha-iil tabah ưng Aku kah rauriq; Ama aku nek Yaang bhi haanh aku, hơq nôôq pe đóók Yaang chêk kơi Ađó nek Yaang Pleng ưng ađêi. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Nôôq pe biêh kah n'nal Ađó, bơơi aku n'nal Ađó. Lơq la aku praaq kơi ađô: ‘Aku kah n'nal Ađó,’ aku nek manưih praaq chachââr thê kơi nôôq pe. Dhơ kơi ađek, aku n'nal Ađó lơq xâng jư paraaq Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Ap-ra-haam, abhươp avuôq nôôq pe marhaal marlaat buôn ve chóóm rââm lêi tangêi ưng Aku, ađó ơi lêi lơq bhuui sương.” <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Kơi ađek nek manưih Jo Thaaiq móón palơq Ađó: “Amei kah đuôh xââng jêt tuôi, hơq Amei ơi lêi Ap-ra-haam?” <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “Alua, alua, aku praaq palơq nôôq pe, xók kah ve ơi mat Ap-ra-haam, aku TALUÔN VE.” <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Taai ađek, piđó chââih dhơl đóng glơm leq Ađó, bơơi Chuôq Jê-su palââp mat lơq vôôiq gluh tââq đong bhanuôih.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Hayơq xók bhêêl vôôiq kalơng, Ađó lêi mưi nak kabaang tââq bhêêl tame n'niên. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Nôôq môôn-đô Ađó tamóh Ađó kơi ađô: “Thêi ơơi, ngaai ơi têêng matu, ađó ađek môôiq amêêq ama ađó ađek, đóng hayơq ađó tame bâân n'niên ơi kabaang?” <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi bóóp: “Eh rau ađó ađek têêng matu, kung eh rau amêêq ama ađó ađek, bơơi chêk nek đóng tarnêêng ưng Yaang Pleng bâân tapakah dhiq ađó ađek. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Ađô nek rau kơng bhlơng đóng nôôq he đóng têêng tarnêêng ưng Yaang đu kayua thêi xók bhêêl dyơq tangêi. Hayum ravang tơk nek bhêêl kah ngaai ve chóóm têêng tarnêêng dyơq. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Xók bhêêl thêi tơơt dhiq hóng katiêk, thêi nek taklaaq brương ưng hóng katiêk.” <verse eid="JHN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Xong xók praaq nôôq paraaq achêk, Ađó kathui leq katiêk, lơq palơq đơơk havi, Ađó lok xar bhiq, hayơq xut đóng ađó bhiq ađek dhiq bơơr hót mat ưng ađó ađek. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Ađó praaq palơq manưih kabaang: “Phaai vôôiq buôch dhiq atông Si-lô-ê” (ađó lók nek “Bâân Kayua Vôôiq”). Kơi ađek, ađó vôôiq lơq buôch mat, hayơq brương mat kơi kaxu. <verse eid="JHN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Tââq ađek, nôôq manưih dharing tapóóng lơq nôôq manưih ơi lêi ađó ađek xók loom, tââq bhêêl ađó nek mưi manưih nhanhan, piđó móón: “Eh dhơq ađôk nek manưih biêh tơơt nhanhan?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Maphơn móón kơi ađô: “Ađek nek ađó achêk.” Maphơn lââng nek móón: “Mơq eh rau, dhơ kơi ađek, manưih ađek nek thê ađó.” Ađó nek bhiêk móón kơi ađô: “Chênh nek aku.” <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Kơi ađek hayơq, piđó móón palơq ađó: “Ng'kơi têêng mat amei chóóm brương?” <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Ađó ađek ââi bóóp: “Manưih bâân đóók nek Jê-su ơi lok abhiq lơq xut mat aku, hayơq kayua aku kơi ađô: ‘Phaai vôôiq tơk Si-lô-ê lơq buôch.’ Đóng hơq, xong xók vôôiq lơq buôch, aku chóóm bâân lêi.” <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Piđó móón palơq ađó: “Manưih achêk tơơt n'dhiq?” Ađó ađek ââi: “Aku kah n'nal.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Piđó đââng ađó ađek, manưih laloom ahei ơi kabaang, tơk nôôq manưih Pha-ri-si. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />(Xók achêk nek tangêi Sa-baat Chuôq Jê-su ơi lok abhiq lơq pơơh mat ưng ađó ađek xók tangêi achêk.) <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Tââq ađek, nôôq manưih Pha-ri-si vil kung tamóh ađó ng'kơi têêng hơq amei bâân brương mat. Hayơq ađó ađek móón palơq piđó: “Ađó achêk xut abhiq leq mat aku, lơq aku vôôiq buôch nek chóóm lêi.” <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Xong ađek, bơơr pe nak kalóóng nôôq manưih Pha-ri-si praaq: “Manưih ađô kah mađó leq Yaang Pleng, taai ađó kah huuiq jư tangêi Sa-baat.” Maphơn lââng nek móón: “Ng'kơi têêng mưi nak, nek đu ve matu, ve chóóm têêng nôôq kanal chrih kơi ađek?” Lơq hayơq ve rau tablah xóng ađêi kalóóng m'pơng piđó. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Kơi ađek hơq piđó tamóh ađó kabaang machu dyơq: “Amei praaq hau rau leq Ađó ađek, tââq xók Ađó achêk ơi pơơh mat amei?” Nek hayơq, ađó móón kơi ađô: “Ađó achêk nek mưi manưih đââng truuih.” <verse eid="JHN 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Taai kơi achêk, manưih Jo Thaaiq kah huuiq chiên leq ađó kơi ađó ađek ơi biêh kabaang hơq chóóm bâân lêi, patơk mơ xók piđó kayua dhaloong amêêq ama ưng ađó ađek, nek manưih ơi yươh kaliêng mat. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Piđó tamóh amêêq ama ađó kơi ađô: “Ve alua ađôk nek akóón ưng bơơr nhưa, manưih đu bơơr nhưa móón nek tame n'niên ơi kabaang? Kơi ađek nek, ng'kơi têêng xók đôk ađó ađek chóóm lêi?” <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Kơi achêk nek amêêq ama ưng ađó ââi bóóp lơq nhiđó móón: “Bơơr yưa bâân n'nal kơi, ađôk nek akóón padruuih bơơr yưa, lơq kơi ađó bâân gluh n'niên ơi kabaang. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Bơơi xók ađôk, ng'kơi têêng ađó chóóm bâân lêi, bơơr yưa kah n'nal, môôiq ngaai ơi pơơh mat ưng ađó, bơơr yưa kah n'nal. Nhan tamóh ađó; ađó dyóp gamak taha. Ađó e tư móón đóng achak araang ađêi.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Akonh kan ađó praaq nôôq paraaq kơi ađek taai nhiđó kakhin manưih Jo Thaaiq. Taai manưih Jo Thaaiq ơi markơi paraaq hayơq, kơi la ngaai đu đơơp móón Ađó nek Chuôq Kriit, manưih achêk bâân tađuôi lơh tââq đong gươl. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Taai kơi ađek amêêq ama ađó ơi móón kơi ađô: “Ađó dyóp taha gamak, nhan tamóh ađó.” <verse eid="JHN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Kơi ađek hơq, tơk chu đu bơơr, piđó yua dhaloong manưih đu ơi glêh bâân kabaang lơq móón palơq ađó: “Phaai tapôông cha-iil tabah đóng Yaang Pleng. Nôôq he n'nal kơi manưih ađek nek mưi đu ve matu.” <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Kơi achêk hayơq ađó ađek ââi: “Ađó achêk nek manưih ve matu môôiq kah, aku kah n'nal. Aku n'nal mưi rau, ađek nek dhơ bâân kabaang, bơơi xók đôk aku chóóm bâân lêi.” <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Tââq ađek, piđó móón palơq ađó: “Manưih achêk ơi têêng harau đóng amei? Ađó ađek ơi pơơh mat amei ng'kơi dhơq?” <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Ađó ââi bóóp piđó: “Aku ơi truuih đóng nôôq pe aq, hơq nôôq pe kah xâng! Hau nôôq pe kiêng xâng lóóiq dyơq? Kah alua nôôq pe kung kiêng val xar môôn-đô ưng Ađó achêk kơi?” <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Lơq hayơq piđó chaleq chapeeng ađó lơq praaq: “Amei hơq nek môôn-đô ưng ađó ađek, dyơq nôôq yi nek môôn-đô ưng Môôi-se. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Nôôq he n'nal kơi Yaang Pleng praaq palơq Môôi-se, bơơi manưih ađô, nôôq yi kah n'nal nek tââq tiq abhral.” <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Manưih padruuih parkonh chróót ââi lơq praaq palơq piđó: “Đôk nek rau ađô hơq nek chrih, kơi Ađó achêk ơi pơơh mat aku hơq nôôq pe kah n'nal Ađó achêk nek tââq tiq abhral. <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Nôôq he n'nal kơi Yaang Pleng kah tameng xâng nôôq manưih matu lơt, bơơi la ngaai đu ve lóóm bhi chap lơq têêng ting karnóq kiêng Ađó, nek Ađó tameng xâng manưih achêk. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Tââq hanua hana, kah glêh bâân xâng chiên mưi chanak chanâ pơơh mat ưng manưih kabaang tââq bhêêl tame n'niên. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />La manưih ađô eh rau nek tââq Yaang Pleng, nek manưih achêk kah kơi têêng chóóm dhơ dharau tarnêêng.” <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Piđó ââi lóóiq lơq móón ađó: “Amei tabhơt bâân n'niên kalóóng matu lơt hơq amei dyơq pachóóm pató nôôq yi alua?” Hayơq piđó chuih ađó ađek gluh.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Chuôq Jê-su xâng kơi piđó ơi dhalươq ađó gluh leq nguôi nek tabâân lum ađó, Chuôq praaq: “Amei ve huuiq dhiq Akóón Manưih kah?” <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Ađó ađek ââi bóóp lơq praaq: “Manưih achêk nek ngaai, Chuôq ơơi, đóng aku ve chóóm huuiq leq Ađó?” <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó: “Amei kung ơi lêi Ađó, lơq ađek nek manưih dyơq papraaq palơq amei ađôk.” <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Xók achêk, ađó móón: “Chuôq ơơi, aku huuiq”, lơq amei bhuôih kakoh Chuôq. <verse eid="JHN 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq: “Aku ơi bhral kalóóng hóng katiêk ađô ơi rau praaq xêi, hơq đóng nôôq manưih kah lêi, ve chóóm bâân lêi, lơq nôôq manưih chóóm lêi val xar kabaang kapôk.” <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Tââq kalóóng kabhuh manưih Pha-ri-si xók tơơt dhiq ađek palơq Ađó, piđó xâng nôôq paraaq chêk, nek tamóh Ađó: “Ve kơq nôôq yi kung pâng kabaang óh?” <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “La nôôq pe pâng kabaang hơq alua nek nôôq pe kah ve matu, bơơi xók đôk nôôq pe móón kơi ađô: ‘Nôôq yi chóóm lêi.’ Nek hayơq, matu ưng nôôq pe biêh dyơq ađek.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />“Alua, alua, Aku praaq palơq nôôq pe, ngaai kah mót hót palóng xók vôôiq mót karól trưưu, hơq vil dyók mót hót kalơng lââng, ađek nek đu tatông lơq đu papei. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Bơơi manưih tââq palóng vôôiq mót nek manưih jư ưng trưưu. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Manưih đương palóng lóng palóng đóng manưih achêk, lơq Trưưu xâng dhariêng ưng manưih jư, hayơq manưih jư dhaloong dhalam achak trưưu ưng ađêi hơq đââng piđó gluh leq nguôi. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Xók manưih jư ơi đââng bhơt trưưu ađêi gluh, ađó vôôiq loom piđó, hayơq trưưu ting tatun ađó, ơi piđó keen n'nal dhariêng ưng manưih jư. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Bơơi piđó alua dhakơi e kah vôôiq ting manưih chrih, palâh lóóiq, piđó mut klôôn tââq ađó, taai piđó kah keen n'nal dhariêng ưng nôôq manưih chrih.” <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq babi ađô đóng piđó, bơơi nôôq manưih ađek kah n'nal nôôq rau Ađó praaq palơq piđó nek hau.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Kơi achêk hơq, Chuôq Jê-su vil praaq palơq piđó: “Alua, alua Aku praaq đóng nôôq pe kơi Aku nek beq palóng ưng trưưu. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Tabhơt nôôq ngaai bhral laloom Aku nek manưih tatông lơq manưih papei, bơơi trưưu kah ting xâng kabhuh piđó. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Aku nek beq palóng. La ngaai manưih vôôiq mót makơi lơq Aku, nek manưih achêk e bâân paq; hayơq manưih achêk e vôôiq mót, vôôiq gluh lơq tabâân lêi klung bhơơi. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Manưih tatông kah bhral la kah alua nek buôn tông pei, leng đet lơq leng kaxiêt. Aku bhral đóng trưưu ve parmông lơq ve bâân kơi xưa raai. <verse eid="JHN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />Aku nek manưih jư kre liêm. Manưih jư kre liêm. Đơơp chêt parhââm mamông ađêi taai trưưu. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Manưih têêng makông, taai eh rau nek manưih jư, hơq trưưu eh rau nek ưng ađó, hơq ađó lêi axing bhral nek lơơi mak kơi trưưu lơq mut paloh achak, dyơq axing kóóp pei trưưu lơq têêng đóng tachêh bil, <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />ơi taai ađó nek manưih têêng makông hơq palơq ađó, rau karaang gamang eh rau nek leq trưưu. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Aku nek manưih jư kre liêm, Aku đơơp n'nal trưưu ưng Aku, lơq trưưu ưng Aku đơơp n'nal Aku, <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />i kơi Ama n'nal Aku, Aku kung n'nal Ama; lơq Aku đơơp chêt parhââm mamông ađêi taai trưưu. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Aku ve nôôq trưưu lââng hơq kah tơơt kalóóng karól ađô. Piđó kung kơi ađek, kơng Aku đââng chô, lơq piđó e xâng dhariêng Aku, hayơq e chapiên ve mưi kanan, palơq mưi manưih jư. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Taai rau ađô, Ama nh'nhơr Aku, taai Aku đơơp chêt parhââm mamông ađêi đóng machu dyơq, Aku ve chóóm bâân đơơp ađó. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Kah ngaai tabil parhââm mamông Aku tââq Aku, dhơ kơi ađek, Aku tư ađêi đơơp chêt ađó. Aku ve mataai đơơp chêt parhââm mamông ađêi, lơq Aku ve mataai đơơp pei ađó machu dyơq. Aku ơi đơơp paraaq kayua ađô tââq Ama Aku.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Rau tablah tachia vil yuur vaaih dhiq m'pơng nôôq manưih Jo Thaaiq taai nôôq paraaq chêk. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Xók ahêq, bơk manưih kalóóng kabhuh piđó móón: “Manưih ađô bâân abhưi bóq lơq bil karnóq. Kơi nôôq pe tameng xâng Ađó?” <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Maphơn lââng nek móón: “Ađôk kah alua nek nôôq paraaq ưng manưih bâân abhưi bóq. Ve kơq abhưi ve chóóm pơơh mat đu kabaang?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Xong ađek, Bhiêk Bhuôih Tapôông yuur têêng dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem. Xók achêk nek nil ha-ót, <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />lơq Chuôq Jê-su dyơq vôôiq val kalóóng đong bhanuôih dhiq hiêng Sa-lô-môôn. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Xong tơk, nôôq manưih Jo Thaaiq xavaang praang Ađó, lơq piđó móón palơq Ađó: “Thêi bhiêk têêng bhayuih kalóóng lóóm ưng nôôq yi patơk mơ dyơq? La thêi nek Chuôq Paq Manưih, phaai praaq kơi rathaai kluôh pakah đóng nôôq yi.” <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi bóóp piđó: “Aku ơi praaq palơq nôôq pe, lơq nôôq pe kah huuiq. Nôôq tarnêêng đu Aku têêng kalóóng dhanóók Ama Aku, piđó truuih đuui leq Aku. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Dhơ kơi ađek, nôôq pe kah huuiq taai nôôq pe eh mađó leq trưưu ưng Aku. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Trưưu Aku xâng dhariêng Aku, dyơq Aku đơơp n'nal piđó, lơq piđó ting Aku. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Aku kung đóng leq piđó parmông nh'chró chró, lơq piđó alua dhakơi kah bâân hư bil tơk taluôn luôn, lơq e kah ngaai bâân n'drooih dhơ dhađó trưưu kalóóng nôôq piđó tââq têi Aku. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Ama Aku, Yaang ơi đóng piđó leq Aku, nek kataai karơ lơh dyóp rau, lơq kah ngaai ve chóóm n'drooih piđó tââq têi Ama. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Aku lơq Ama nek mưi.” <verse eid="JHN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Bơơi manưih Jo Thaaiq vil pei dhơl đóng ve chóóm glơm Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Chuôq Jê-su tar-ââi palơq piđó: “Aku ơi pakah đóng nôôq pe bơk tarnêêng liêm tââq Ama. Nôôq pe glơm dhơl aku taai n'đó tarnêêng kalóóng sôôq nôôq tarnêêng ađek?” <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Nôôq manưih Jo Thaaiq ââi bóóp Ađó: “Nôôq yi kah glơm dhơl amei taai tarnêêng liêm, bơơi taai matu praaq chôlô, lơq taai amei, nek mưi manưih dhiq katiêk, dyơq tư đóók ađêi nek Yaang Pleng.” <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi palơq piđó: “Kalóóng gani ưng nôôq pe, eh dhơq ve paraaq bâân xaraq kơi ađô: ‘Aku praaq: “Nôôq akóón nek yaang”’ kah alua? <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />La Ađó đóók piđó, nek nôôq manưih đu paraaq ưng Yaang Pleng tơk palơq, nek yaang (lơq Bha-aar Yaang Pleng kah chóóm bâân m'peq pahư), <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />hơq kơi nôôq pe móón palơq Yaang đu Yaang Pleng ơi pantua lơq đu kayua mót kalóóng hóng katiêk kơi ađô: ‘Amei praaq chôlô,’ taai aku móón: ‘Aku nek Akóón Yaang Pleng’? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />La Aku kah dyơq têêng nôôq tarnêêng ưng Ama aku, nek óóq huuiq aku. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Bơơi la aku dyơq têêng, đóng dhơ nôôq pe kah huuiq aku, nek phaai huuiq nôôq tarnêêng achêk, đóng nôôq pe ve chóóm n'nal lơq bhluuch kơi Ama kalóóng Aku, lơq Aku kalóóng Ama.” <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Kơi ađek, piđó vil tabâân kơi kóóp Ađó, hơq Ađó xooq tââq têi piđó.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Mưi chu dyơq, Ađó val chô hót tóór tôôh karuung Jô-đen, tơk dhiq đu laloom ahei Jang têêng bap-teem hayơq Ađó tơơt dhiq ađek. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Bơk manưih tơk palơq Ađó lơq piđó móón kơi ađô: “Dhơ Jang ơi kah têêng n'đó kanal chrih, bơơi dyóp rau hơq Jang ơi praaq leq manưih ađô nek dhalam.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Lơq dhiq ađek, bơk manưih tabóq lóóm huuiq dhiq Ađó.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Xók achêk, ve mưi nak achêk vaaih ka-ai, achak La-xa-rơ tââq Bê-tha-ni, dhiq kanóón ưng Ma-ri lơq anó ưng ađó nek Ma-thê. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Dyơq Ma-ri nek manưih xut dhơu thum đóng Chuôq hayơq dyuut dyung Ađó palơq xok ưng ađêi, hơq adhi padruuih ưng ađó nek La-xa-rơ biêh dyơq dhuôr ka-ai. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Kơi ađek hơq, bơơr miing móóq muôt manưih pagơơi bóóp tơk Ađó kơi ađô: “Chuôq ơơi, lêi tôôh manưih đu Amei nh'nhơr dyơq dhuôr ka-ai.” <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Bơơi xong xók xâng kơi ađek, Chuôq Jê-su praaq: “Ka-ai ađô yươq chóóm tơk mơ chêt, dhơ kơi ađek, taai cha-iil tabah ưng Yaang Pleng, đóng Akóón Yaang Pleng bâân bhi haanh đươi tarnêêng achêk.” <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />(Chuôq Jê-su nh'nhơr Ma-thê, adhi pađiil ưng ađó, lơq La-xa-rơ.) <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Taai ađek, xók Ađó xâng kơi La-xa-rơ dyơq dhuôr ka-ai, dhơ kơi ađek bhêêl achêk, Ađó raan tơơt lóóiq bơơr tangêi dhiq dham đu Ađó dyơq tơơt. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Xong kơơq, lơh tarnêêng, takajơq achêk, Ađó praaq palơq nôôq môôn-đô: “Nôôq he kơng vôôiq tơk xưưq Ju-đê machu dyơq.” <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Nôôq môôn-đô móón palơq Ađó: “Thêi ơơi, xók đôk manưih Jo Thaaiq dyơq tabâân kơi glơm dhơl thêi, hơq thêi dyơq val chô leq ađek machu dyơq?” <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi: “Kah alua ve majêt bơơr jơ mót mưi tangêi kơi? La ngaai manưih vôôiq kalóóng tangêi, nek manưih achêk yươq n'đóih kalơm, taai ađó ve lêi taklaaq brương ưng hóng katiêk ađô. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Dyơq la ngaai manưih vôôiq kalóóng hayum kanam, nek manưih achêk n'đóih kalơm, taai tarlaaq brương kah tơơt dhiq ađó.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Ađó ơi praaq kơi ađek, hayơq xong ađek, Ađó móón piđó: “La-xa-rơ, parjơơk ưng nôôq he, ơi ngan bêch, bơơi Thêi vôôiq nek đóng Thêi ve chóóm payuur ađó achêk.” <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Kơi achêk hơq, nôôq môôn-đô móón palơq Ađó: “Chuôq ơơi, la ađó achêk ơi ngan bêch, nek anó achêk e chóóm yuur.” <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />(Xók achêk, Chuôq Jê-su biêh praaq leq rau chêt ưng La-xa-rơ, bơơi nôôq manưih ađek ngóq kơi Ađó dyơq praaq leq rau dhêi drơq ưng bhanêch bêch.) <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Kơi ađek hơq, bhêêl ađek Chuôq Jê-su praaq padrêh đóng piđó: “La-xa-rơ ơi chêt. <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Thêi bhuui marhaal ơi taai malơơi malaai ưng adhi anó taai Thêi ơi kah ve mat dhiq ađek, đóng adhi anó ve chóóm huuiq. Dhơ kơi ađek, nôôq he kơng vôôiq leq ađó achêk.” <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Kơi achêk hayơq, Thô-ma, bâân đóók nek Đi-điim, móón palơq nôôq môôn-đô ting vôôiq palơq Ađó: “Nôôq he kung chóóm vôôiq đóng nôôq he ve chóóm chêt madhiq palơq Ađó.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Taai kơi ađek, xók tơk dham, Chuôq Jê-su đơơp lêi ađó ađek ơi tơơt kalóóng ping puôn tangêi aq. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Xók achêk, Bê-tha-ni tơơt đan Jê-ru-sa-leem, tââq ađek mơ majêt xââng êch-ta-đơ. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Bơk manưih kalóóng sôôq nôôq manưih Jo Thaaiq ơi tơk palơq Ma-thê lơq Ma-ri đóng piđó ve chóóm bhơơl lóóm nhiđó leq manưih adhi padruuih. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Kơi achêk hayơq, xók Ma-thê xâng kơi Chuôq Jê-su bhral, ađó vôôiq kêch Chuôq, dyơq Ma-ri tơơt kalóóng đong. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Xók achêk, Ma-thê móón palơq Chuôq Jê-su: “Chuôq ơơi, la Amei ve tơơt dhiq đôk, hơq alua nek adhi padruuih aku yươq ơi chêt. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Dhơ kơi ađek, patơk mơ bhêêl đôk, aku n'nal kơi tabhơt dhơ dharau hơq Amei nhan Yaang Pleng, Yaang Pleng e đóng leq Amei.” <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó: “Adhi padruuih ưng amei e mamông lóóiq.” <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Ma-thê móón palơq Ađó: “Aku n'nal kơi adhi achêk e mamông lóóiq kalóóng rau mamông lóóiq leq tangêi xariêq parlưch.” <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó: “Thêi nek parmông lóóiq lơq parmông; ngaai manưih huuiq dhiq thêi e mamông, dhơ nek ơi chêt aq; <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />dyơq ngaai mamông hơq huuiq dhiq thêi nek alua dhakơi kah mơ chêt tơk nh'chró chró. Amei ve huuiq rau ađô kah?” <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Ma-thê ââi lóóiq Ađó: “Ơơq, Chuôq ơơi, aku huuiq kơi Amei nek Chuôq Paq Manưih, Akóón Yaang pleng, nek Yaang phaai dhaluônh kalóóng hóng katiêk.” <verse eid="JHN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Praaq kơi ađek xong, ađó val chô lơq dhaloong pantua Ma-ri, adhi ađêi, móón: “Thêi tơơt dhiq ađô lơq dyơq dhaloong adhi.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Xók Ma-ri xâng kơi chêk, ađó đâh parmat yuur dyương lơq tơk palơq Chuôq. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Xók achêk, Chuôq Jê-su kah mót kalóóng bhươl bơơi bhiêk dyơq tơơt dhiq dham đu Ma-thê ơi lum Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Xók achêk, nôôq manưih Jo Thaaiq, nek nôôq manưih dyơq tơơt palơq Ma-ri kalóóng đong lơq pahêêl bhơơl ađó, xók lêi kơi Ma-ri tarhươk tahơn yuur dyương lơq vôôiq gluh leq nguôi, nek ting tapun ađó, ngóq nek ađó vôôiq tơk ping đóng ađó dhiq ađek nhiim. <verse eid="JHN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Kơi achêk hayơq, dhalam xók Ma-ri tơk dhiq Chuôq Jê-su dyương dhêi, bhêêl bâân lêi Ađó, Ma-ri chakoh takól dhiq dyung Ađó móón palơq Ađó: “Kakoh Chuôq, la Amei biêh tơơt dhiq đôk, hơq alua nek adhi padruuih aku ơi yươq chêt.” <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Kơi ađek, xók Chuôq Jê-su lêi Ma-ri nhiim, lơq nôôq manưih Jo Thaaiq vôôiq chadrươh palơq ađó kung nhiim, Ađó lêi karuôq luônh lóóm kalóóng lóóm ravaai lơq chênh Ađó kala bhrêq nhiim. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Ađó tamóh: “Adhi anó tơp anó achêk n'đó dhiq?” Piđó móón palơq Ađó: “Chuôq ơơi, vêq vôôiq lơq lêi.” <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Chuôq Jê-su nhiim. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Taai kơi ađek, nôôq manưih Jo Thaaiq móón: “Lêi tôôh, Ađó achêk nh'nhơr La-xa-rơ n'nal mơ!” <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Bơơi bơơr pe chanak kalóóng sôôq piđó móón: “Ađó ađô, nek manưih ơi pơơh mat ưng manưih kabaang, biêh kah rau chóóm têêng đuôh lơơi đóng manưih ađô yươq chêt?” <verse eid="JHN 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Taai kơi ađek, xók bhêêl vil karuôq luônh lóóm kalóóng achak, Chuôq Jê-su vôôiq tơk xaal ping. Xók achêk, ađek nek mưi bóng dhơl, lơq mưi bhangôh dhơl bâân patơơt kađơp dhalam palóng. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Chuôq Jê-su yua: “Phaai tââi bhangôh dhơl aq.” Ma-thê, mamóóq ưng manưih ơi chêt, móón palơq Ađó: “Chuôq ơơi, adhi achêk huôl n'naq aq, taai mađôk nek tangêi đu puôn.” <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó: “Eh alua Aku ơi praaq palơq amei kơi la amei huuiq, nek amei e lêi cha-iil tabah ưng Yaang Pleng kơi?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Kơi ađek hơq, piđó patââi bhangôh dhơl aq. Hayơq Chuôq Jê-su angơơq mat leq Pleng lơq praaq: “Ama ơơi, Akóón ma-ơơn Ama taai Ama ơi tameng xâng Akóón. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Hơq Akóón biêh ơi n'nal kơi Ama taluôn luôn tameng xâng, bơơi Akóón yuur praaq ơi taai kabhuh ganơr dyơq dyương xirvir dhiq ađôk, đóng piđó ve chóóm huuiq kơi Ama kayua Akóón bhral.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Lơq xong xók praaq kơi ađek, Ađó yuur dhaloong karơ dhariêng: “La-xa-rơ, phaai vôôiq gluh leq nguôi!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Manưih ơi chêt vôôiq gluh, dyung lơq têi biêh dyơq tapươr bhaai raleng, dyơq mat ađó dyơq tapươr khan. Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “Phaai yuur lương poor ađó ađek lơq đóng ađó ađek vôôiq.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Taai ađek, bơk manưih kalóóng kabhuh manưih Jo Thaaiq, nek nôôq manưih ơi tơk tham Ma-ri lơq xong xók xâng lêi tarnêêng Ađó têêng, piđó ơi tabóq lóóm huuiq dhiq Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Bơơi bơơr pe chanak kalóóng kabhuh piđó vôôiq tơk palơq kabhuh manưih Pha-ri-si lơq truuih lóóiq đóng nôôq manưih ađô nôôq tarnêêng đu Chuôq Jê-su ơi têêng.<verse eid="JHN 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Nek hayơq, nôôq takóh kadhâng pabhuôih bhơt liêm palơq manưih Pha-ri-si dhaloong karong kabhuh takóh Jo Thaaiq lơq tapraaq tamóh: “Nôôq he phaai têêng harau ađôk, taai manưih ađô têêng bơk kanal chrih bhlơng. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />La nôôq he lơơi mak kơi Ađó achêk kơi ađek, nek dyóp ngaai e huuiq leq Ađó achêk, hayơq manưih La-ma e tơk lơq pei jeng bhơt dhiq ađô palơq katiêk karuung ưng nôôq he.” <verse eid="JHN 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Dhơ kơi ađek, Kaai-phe, mưi chanak kalóóng sôôq piđó, nek takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm kalóóng kamó ađek, móón palơq piđó: “Nôôq pe kah n'nal rauriq. <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Nôôq pe kah kanóq chamet kơi ađek nek rau liêm lơh đóng nôôq pe xók lơơi mưi chanak chêt klóóih đóng dhanuôr manưih hơq tabhơt dhanuôr manưih yươq bâân chêt bil.” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Xók achêk, ađó ơi praaq rau ađek eh tơk tââq chak araang ađó, bơơi taai nek takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm kamó ađek, hayơq ađó loom praaq taruuih kơi Chuôq Jê-su ravang phaai chêt taai dhanuôr manưih, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />lơq eh chapiên nek taai dhanuôr manưih ađô, hơq dyơq nek đóng akóón anaaq ưng Yaang Pleng pâng xraang xruk ve chóóm karong kaboq xar mưi. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Kơi achêk hơq, tââq tangêi ađek, piđó tabâân mangê đóng piđó ve chóóm đââng Ađó mót dham chêt.<verse eid="JHN 11:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Taai kơi ađek, Chuôq Jê-su kah dyơq vôôiq val pakah dhiq m'pơng manưih Jo Thaaiq dyơq, bơơi Ađó tââi lơh tââq ađek vôôiq tơk parah đan kruung vơng, kalóóng mưi kanóón bâân đóók nek Ep-ra-iim. Ađó tơơt dhiq ađek palơq nôôq môôn-đô. <verse eid="JHN 11:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Xók achêk, Bhiêk Jalơh ưng dhanuôr Jo Thaaiq đan tơk, bơk manưih tââq bhươl kanóón vôôiq đơk tơk Jê-ru-sa-leem xók kah ơi ganah Bhiêk Jalơh đóng piđó ve chóóm pasek chênh ađêi. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Kơi achêk nek, piđó chik chêk Chuôq Jê-su, lơq praaq palơq xóng piđó xók dyương kalóóng đong bhuôih: “Palơq nôôq pe, tarnêêng achêk parư ngóq n'đó kơi? Kơi ađó achêk dhakơi e kah tơk tơơt bhiêk?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Xók achêk, nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm lơq manưih Pha-ri-si ơi pagluh praaq kayua, buôn đóng la ngaai đu n'nal Ađó tơơt n'dhiq, manưih achêk phaai móón lóóiq đóng palââng ve chóóm kóóp Ađó.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Xong ađek, chapat tangêi kah ơi Bhiêk Jalơh, Chuôq Jê-su vôôiq tơk Bê-tha-ni, dhiq La-xa-rơ tơơt, ađôk nek manưih đu Chuôq Jê-su ơi têêng mamông lóóiq tââq kan chêt. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Kơi achêk nek piđó dhoon yaauq Ađó vaar blót dhiq ađek, lơq Ma-thê nek têêng yaauq, dyơq La-xa-rơ nek mưi kalóóng nôôq manưih tơơt madhiq baang cha palơq Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Tââq ađek, xong xók pei mưi kanơng dhơu thum kaam tung yươq taklaai lóng kiiq bhlơng, Ma-ri xut dyung Chuôq Jê-su, lơq dyuut dyung Ađó palơq xok ưng ađêi. Xók achêk, dhanong đong bâân bhrưi bhrai palơq n'naq thum ưng dhơu achêk. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Bơơi Ju-đa Ich-ka-ri-ôôt, mưi kalóóng nôôq môôn-đô Ađó, đu ravang têêng tamôôp Ađó, móón kơi ađô: <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Ađó kơi klóng dhơu thum ađô kah chóóm đââng baan raxal pei pe hariêng đơ-ni-ê, hayơq đóng nh'xóóng leq manưih ngeeo?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />(Xók achêk, ađó ađek praaq kơi ađek kah alua taai rau karaang kanóq palơq ađó nek leq manưih ngeeo, bơơi taai ađó nek têi tatông papei, lơq xók jư chadhung jêên, ađó pei tông jêên bâân tapôông đóng leq ađek.) <verse eid="JHN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Taai kơi ađek, Chuôq Jê-su praaq: “Phaai lơơi ađó bâân ra-iên, đóng ađó ve chóóm jư dhơu đóng tangêi tơp buur ưng thêi. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Taai adhi anó taluôn ve manưih ngeeo tóór ađêi, bơơi adhi anó kah taluôn luôn ve thêi.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Kơi achêk hayơq mưi kabhuh ganơr bơk tââq nôôq manưih Jo Thaaiq ơi bâân n'nal kơi Ađó dyơq tơơt dhiq ađek, hơq piđó pajươk pơh, eh rau taai chapiên Chuôq Jê-su, hơq kung đóng piđó ve chóóm bâân lêi La-xa-rơ, nek manưih đu Ađó ơi têêng mamông lóóiq tââq kan chêt. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Bơơi nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm ơi mangê kanóq, ng'kơi đóng piđó kung ve chóóm leng luôn lơq La-xa-rơ; <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />ơi taai ađó, bơk manưih Jo Thaaiq ơi xooq lơơi hơq huuiq dhiq Chuôq Jê-su.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Tangêi tatun, tanóói dhanuôr lóng bơk, nek nôôq manưih tơk tơơt bhiêk, Xók xâng kơi Chuôq Jê-su dyơq vôôiq tơk Jê-ru-sa-leem, <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />ơi pei nôôq xơq chalón, hayơq piđó vôôiq gluh đóng kêch Ađó lơq driêu karơ: “Hô-sa-na! Bhi haanh Yaang bhral kalóóng dhanóók Chuôq, nek Bhua I-sơ-ra-êên!” <verse eid="JHN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Xók achêk, xók ơi tating bâân mưi panong axeh kamór, Chuôq Jê-su tơơt dhââng dhiq ađó, kơi paraaq bâân xaraq: <verse eid="JHN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Nô akóón pađiil Si-ôôn, óóq kakhin. Lêi tôôh, Bhua ưng akóón dyơq bhral, dhââng dhiq axeh akóón.” <verse eid="JHN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Bhêêl tarnââp, nôôq môôn-đô ưng Ađó kah n'nal nôôq tarnêêng ađek; bơơi xók Chuôq Jê-su ơi bâân cha-iil tabah, nek piđó hei lóóiq kơi nôôq paraaq achêk ơi bâân xaraq leq Ađó, palââng kung ơi têêng kơi ađek leq Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Xong ađek, kabhuh ganơr maar truuih đuui leq Ađó, piđó nek nôôq manưih ve mat palơq Ađó xók Ađó dhaloong La-xa-rơ gluh tââq bóng ping lơq têêng ađó mamông lóóiq tââq kan chêt. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Ơi taai ađek, tanóói dhanuôr kung vôôiq gluh kêch Ađó, taai piđó xâng kơi Ađó ơi têêng mưi kanal chrih kơi ađek. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Kơi ađek hơq, manưih Pha-ri-si móón palơq xóng piđó: “Nôôq pe lêi nek nôôq pe kah têêng vaaih rau matich mataang? Lêi tôôh, bhơt manưih hóng katiêk ơi vôôiq ting Ađó ađek.”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Xók achêk, ve bơơr pe chanak manưih Hi-laap achêk kalóóng sôôq nôôq manưih vôôiq đơk đóng piđó ve chóóm bhuôih haanh mót ganah bhiêk. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Kơi achêk hayơq, nôôq manưih ađô tơk lum Phi-liip, manưih ađó gluh tââq Bêêt-saai-đa, xưưq Ga-li-lê, lơq palââng đươi ađó, kơi ađô: “Abhươp ơơi, nôôq yi kiêng lum Thêi Jê-su.” <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Phi-liip vôôiq lơq móón palơq En-rê; En-rê palơq Phi-liip vôôiq hayơq móón palơq Chuôq Jê-su. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Bhêêl achêk, Chuôq Jê-su ââi lóóiq piđó, kơi ađô: “Jơ ơi tơk hơq đóng Akóón Manưih bâân bhi haanh. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Alua, alua, Aku praaq palơq adhi anó, la kaliêng aviq mi, xong xók bâân tachóói leq katiêk, kah chêt aq, nek ađó bhiêk parngau mưi ađêi; bơơi la ađó chêt aq, nek ađó e bóóng pale bơk. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Ngaai manưih nh'nhơr parmông ađêi nek e bil ađó; bơơi ngaai geet parmông ađêi kalóóng đơơi đôk e bâân jư ađó đóng parmông taluôn luôn. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />La ngaai đu têêng yaauq thêi, manưih achêk phaai ting thêi; lơq dhiq thêi tơơt, manưih đu têêng yaauq thêi e kung tơơt dhiq ađek. La ngaai đu têêng yaauq thêi, nek Ama e bhi chap manưih achêk. <verse eid="JHN 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />Xók ađôk, ravaai thêi dyơq nhok karnóq, lơq thêi hơq praaq harau? ‘Ama ơơi, nhan paq akóón tââq xók ađôk?’ Dhơ kơi ađek, chênh taai tarnêêng achêk hơq thêi ơi tơk kalóóng xók ađôk. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Ama ơơi, nhan bhi haanh dhanóók Ama.” Kơi chêk hayơq, mưi dhariêng praaq tơk tââq pleng: “Aku ơi bâân bhi haanh lơq Aku e dyơq bhi haanh.” <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Xong tơk, taai biêh ơi dyương dhiq ađek lơq xâng lêi, kabhuh ganơr móón kơi dhariêng grơm kamlaaq tame xuul vaaih. Masôôq lââng móón: “Mưi dhơn Pleng ơi praaq palơq Ađó achêk.” <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi lóóiq lơq Ađó móón: “Dhariêng praaq ađô kah tar-auq taai Aku, bơơi nek taai nôôq pe. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Xók ađôk nek rau xêi xanêi ưng hóng katiêk ađô: xók ađôk, manưih têêng kala hóng katiêk ađô e bâân m'peq leq nguôi. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Dyơq Aku, mưi xók Aku bâân yuur tayông tââq katiêk, Aku e đââng dyóp ngaai tơk palơq aku.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Xók achêk, Ađó xók praaq rau ađô đóng chaleq leq n'đó kơi chêt hơq Ađó ravang đơơp. <verse eid="JHN 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Kơi achêk hayơq tanóói dhanuôr tamóh lóóiq palơq Ađó: “Nôôq yi ve xâng tââq gani kơi Chuôq Paq Manưih e dyơq tơk taluôn luôn. Kơi Amei móón kơi ađô: ‘Rau pa-eep nek palơq Akóón Manưih nek yuur bâân tayông’? Ngaai nek Akóón Manưih achêk?” <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Kơi achêk hayơq, Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “Rau brương dyơq tơơt palơq nôôq pe mưi ganah gađóq dyơq. Phaai jađaang vôôiq xók bhêêl nôôq pe ve rau brương, đóng bóng kanam yươq kóóp jư nôôq pe. Manưih jađaang vôôiq kalóóng bóng kanam kah n'nal ađêi vôôiq n'leq. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Xók bhêêl nôôq pe ve rau brương, phaai huuiq leq rau brương đóng nôôq pe bâân val xar akóón ưng đu brương.” Chuôq Jê-su praaq nôôq paraaq ađek hayơq yuur vôôiq, Ađó kadrêi ađêi tââq piđó. <verse eid="JHN 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Dhơ ve Ađó ơi têêng lóng bơk kanal chrih toom mat piđó, bơơi piđó biêh kah huuiq leq Ađó, <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />đóng paraaq Ê-saai nek manưih đââng taruuih bâân tajaap, hơq ađó ơi móón:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">“Kakoh Chuôq, ngaai huuiq paraaq truuih lóóiq ưng nôôq akóón,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">lơq tapaang têi ưng Chuôq ơi pakah đóng ngaai leq?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Taai kơi achêk, piđó kah chóóm huuiq, ơi taai Ê-saai vil praaq dyơq:<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Ađó ơi têêng mat piđó kabaang, lơq Ađó ơi têêng đóng lóóm piđó kakơu nhâng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">đóng n'jau kơi piđó ve chóóm lêi palơq mat, lơq n'nal rau kalóóng lóóm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">hayơq palâh val lóóiq,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">lơq aku e payươh đóng piđó.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Ê-saai ơi truuih nôôq paraaq achêk taai Ê-saai ơi rââm lêi cha-iil tabah ưng Ađó lơq praaq leq Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Dhơ kơi chêk, dhakơi kung ve bơk manưih kalóóng kabhuh têêng gamak huuiq leq Ađó, bơơi ơi taai nôôq manưih Pha-ri-si, hayơq piđó kah khin praaq pakah hơq đóng piđó yươq bâân tađuôi lơh tââq gươl. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Taai piđó kiêng đươi rau bhi haanh tââq palââng lơh nek rau bhi haanh tââq Yaang Pleng.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Xók achêk, Chuôq Jê-su karơ dhariêng praaq kơi ađô: “Ngaai huuiq dhiq aku kah chapiên nek huuiq leq aku, bơơi dyơq nek huuiq tơk Yaang đu kayua aku, <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />lơq ngaai lêi aku nek lêi Yaang đu kayua aku. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Aku ơi tơk têêng rau brương kalóóng hóng katiêk, đóng ngaai huuiq leq aku yươq bhiêk tơơt kalóóng bóng kanam. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Lơq la ngaai đu xâng paraaq Aku hơq kah katiêu jư, nek Aku kah xêi xanêi manưih achêk; taai Aku ơi bhral eh rau đóng Aku xêi xanêi manưih hóng katiêk, bơơi đóng Aku paq hóng katiêk. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Ngaai đu kah đươi aku lơq kah đơơp pơh đươi paraaq aku nek ve Yaang xêi xanêi manưih achêk. Chênh paraaq đu aku ơi praaq ađô e xêi xanêi manưih achêk leq tangêi xariêq parlưch. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Taai aku eh taai chênh ađêi đu praaq, bơơi Yaang kayua aku, chênh Ama ơi đóng paraaq kayua leq aku, n'đó paraaq aku kơng truuih lơq hau rau aku kơng praaq. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Lơq aku n'nal kơi paraaq kayua ưng Ađó nek rau parmông taluôn luôn. Kơi ađek hơq, nôôq rau aku praaq, kơi Ama ơi truuih đóng aku n'đó kơi, nek aku truuih lóóiq kung kơi achêk.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Xók achêk, kah ơi Bhiêk Jalơh, Chuôq Jê-su n'nal kơi jơ ưng Ađó ơi tơk, hơq đóng Ađó xooq tââq hóng katiêk ađô chô paleq Ama. Xók ơi nh'nhơr nôôq manưih mađó leq ađêi kalóóng hóng katiêk, nek Ađó nh'nhơr piđó đóng tơk xariêq parlưch. <verse eid="JHN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Dyơq cha vaar blót, xong xók abhưi ơi tamót kalóóng lóóm Ju-đa Ich-ka-ri-ôôt, akóón padruuih ưng Si-môôn, đóng ađó baan Chuôq, <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />taai n'nal kơi Ama ơi pajaau kalóóng têi Ađó dyóp rau, lơq n'nal kơi Ađó bhral tââq Yaang Pleng lơq ravang val chô palơq Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Ađó yuur dyương tââq vaar cha, lôh aau nguôi. Lơq xong xók pei khan, Ađó pươr praang chak ađêi. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Xong ađek, Ađó n'toh đơơk leq bhôôk lơq tââp raau dyung ưng nôôq môôn-đô lơq dyuut góh palơq beq khan đu ađó ơi bâân pươr praang ađêi. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Kơi achêk hơq, Ađó tơk leq Si-môôn Phi-e-rơ. Phi-e-rơ móón palơq Ađó: “Chuôq ơơi, Amei raau dyung ưng aku kơi?” <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi lóóiq lơq praaq palơq ađó: “Tarnêêng thêi dyơq têêng, xók đôk amei kah n'nal, bơơi tatun nôôq tarnêêng ađô amei e n'nal.” <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Phi-e-rơ móón palơq Ađó: “Lalua dhakơi kah mơ chóóm amei raau dyung ưng aku.” Chuôq Jê-su ââi lóóiq ađó: “La thêi kah raau đóng amei, nek amei kah ve rau phơn palơq thêi.” <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Si-môôn Phi-e-rơ móón palơq Ađó: “Chuôq ơơi, kah chapiên dyung aku giêl, hơq dyơq lưch têi lơq akoq aku dyơq.” <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó: “Ngaai đu ơi bâân hóm aq nek yươq ve kơng kơi ađek, chapiên mưi raau dyung, dyơq ađó achêk bâân sek tabhơt, lơq adhi anó nek bâân sek bơơi eh rau tabhơt adhi anó.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />(Taai Ađó n'nal ngaai đu têêng tamôôp Ađó, taai kơi ađek Ađó praaq kơi ađô: “Eh rau tabhơt maar bâân sek.”)<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Kơi ađek, xók Ađó ơi raau dyung piđó xong lơq xơp aau nguôi ưng ađêi mót, nek Ađó tơơt chok leq lóóiq, praaq palơq piđó: “Adhi anó ve n'nal hau Aku tame têêng leq adhi anó kah? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Adhi anó đóók Aku nek ‘Thêi’, lơq nek ‘Chuôq’; adhi anó móón pâng bhlơng taai Aku alua nek kơi chêk. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Kơi achêk hơq, la Aku, nek Chuôq, lơq nek Thêi, ơi raau dyung ưng adhi anó, nek adhi anó kung phaai raau dyung ưng xóng ađêi. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Taai thêi ơi têêng xamil đóng adhi anó đóng adhi anó kung têêng i kơi thêi ơi têêng đóng adhi anó. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Alua, alua, Thêi praaq palơq adhi anó, dhơn ratơơq nek kah gamak lơh kala ađêi; đu đââng taruuih kung kah gamak lơh manưih đu kayua ađêi. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />La adhi anó ơi n'nal nôôq rau ađô, nek adhi anó bâân phươk la kơi adhi anó têêng nôôq rau achêk. <verse eid="JHN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />Thêi kah dyơq praaq leq tabhơt adhi anó; thêi n'nal manưih đu thêi ơi chââih — bơơi đóng paraaq Bha-aar Yaang Pleng bâân tajaap: ‘Đu cha beng palơq aku hayuur takơm ađó jơl lóóiq aku.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Tââq bhêêl ađôk, thêi praaq đóng adhi anó xók loom tarnêêng yuur vaaih, đóng xók ađó yuur vaaih, adhi anó ve chóóm huuiq kơi thêi Taluôn Ve. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Alua, alua, thêi praaq palơq adhi anó, ngaai yaauq n'đó manưih đu thêi kayua nek yaauq thêi, lơq ngaai yaauq thêi nek yaauq Yaang đu ơi kayua thêi.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Xók ơi praaq xong nôôq rau achêk, Chuôq Jê-su ranguôq rangóót kalóóng lóóm kanóq, hayơq Ađó đơơp n'nal lơq praaq: “Alua, alua, thêi praaq palơq adhi anó, mưi nak dhiq m'pơng adhi anó e têêng tamôôp thêi.” <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Nôôq môôn-đô tarlêi xóng piđó, kah n'nal Ađó dyơq praaq ngaai leq. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Xók achêk, mưi kalóóng nôôq môôn-đô Ađó, manưih đu Chuôq Jê-su nh'nhơr, dyơq tơơt tóór baang cha, ganương leq tadhưa ưng Chuôq Jê-su. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Taai ađek, Si-môôn Phi-e-rơ kamêch đóng manưih ađô tamóh lêi, “Manưih đu thêi dyơq praaq tơk nek ngaai dhơq?” <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Taai kơi achêk nek hayơq, xong xók pacheeng achak tóór tadhưa Chuôq Jê-su, manưih ađek móón palơq Ađó: “Chuôq ơơi, ađek nek ngaai?” <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi: “Ađek nek manưih đu xong xók tươm paleh beng ađô, Thêi e nia ađó lơq pađơơp leq manưih ađek.” Kơi achêk hayơq, tươm paleh beng achêk xong, Ađó pađơơp đóng Ju-đa akóón ưng Si-môôn Ich-ka-ri-ôôt. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Xong paleh beng achêk, nek bhêêl ađek Sa-taan bóq leq ađó. Kơi ađek hơq, Chuôq Jê-su móón ađó: “Rau amei ravang têêng, nek têêng pađâh aq.” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />(Xók achêk, kah ngaai dyơq tơơt dhiq baang chóóm n'nal taai ng'kơi Chuôq praaq palơq ađó kơi ađek. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Taai bơơr pe nak bhiêk ngóq, taai Ju-đa jư chadhung jêên, hơq Chuôq Jê-su yua ađó: “Phaai kơl nôôq rau kơng vech đóng ganah bhiêk,” môôiq buôn nh'xóóng đóng m'bưưiq ve rau leq manưih ngeeo.) <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Kơi achêk nek, xók ơi đơơp paleh beng, ađó n'drươh vôôiq gluh. Xók achêk, pleng ơi blót.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Kơi ađek, xók ađó ơi vôôiq lơh, Chuôq Jê-su praaq: “Xók ađôk, Akóón Manưih ơi bâân bhi haanh, lơq Yaang Pleng ơi bâân bhi haanh dhiq Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Hayơq Yaang Pleng e bhi haanh Akóón Manưih kalóóng chênh Ađó, lơq Ađó e bhi haanh Akóón Manưih n'drươh ađek. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Nôôq akóón paniên ơơi, thêi tơơt palơq adhi anó mơ maxưưiq dyơq giêl. Adhi anó e chêk thêi, lơq kơi thêi ơi móón palơq nôôq manưih Jo Thaaiq kơi: ‘Leq aku vôôiq, nôôq pe kah chóóm bâân vôôiq,’ xók ađôk, thêi kung praaq kơi ađek palơq adhi anó. <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Thêi đóng leq adhi anó mưi gani pachóóm tame, buôn đóng adhi anó ve chóóm tanhơr xóng ađêi; kơi thêi ơi nh'nhơr adhi anó, đóng adhi anó kung ve chóóm tanhơr xóng ađêi. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />La adhi anó ve lóóm tanhơr đóng xóng ađêi, nek taai ađek, dyóp nak e n'nal kơi adhi anó nek môôn-đô ưng thêi.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Si-môôn Phi-e-rơ móón palơq Ađó: “Chuôq ơơi, n'leq Amei vôôiq?” Chuôq Jê-su ââi bóóp ađó: “Leq aku vôôiq, xók ađôk adhi anó kah chóóm ting đuôh aku, bơơi tatun ki, adhi anó e ting vôôiq.” <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Phi-e-rơ móón palơq Ađó: “Chuôq ơơi, taai ng'kơi aku kah chóóm ting Amei đuôh n'drươh bhêêl ađôk? Aku e đơơp chêt parmông aku taai Amei.” <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi: “Amei e đơơp chêt parmông amei taai thêi? Alua, alua, thêi praaq palơq amei, lalua dhakơi atưưch gôông kah takar patơk xók amei dyiin thêi pe chu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />“Lóóm adhi anó óóq pâng nhok nhói. Adhi anó huuiq leq Yaang Pleng, nek adhi anó kung huuiq leq thêi. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Kalóóng đong Ama aku ve bơk dhiq tơơt. Hơq la kah ve, nek aku dhakơi ve praaq palơq adhi anó ơi, taai aku xók vôôiq đóng ravang ravưa leq adhi anó mưi dhiq. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />La thêi vôôiq lơq ravang ravưa đóng adhi anó mưi dhiq, thêi e tơk machu dyơq lơq kêch adhi anó ting palơq thêi, đóng n'dhiq thêi tơơt nek adhi anó kung tơơt dhiq ađek. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Adhi anó ơi n'nal kalơng tơk leq đu Aku dyơq vôôiq.” <verse eid="JHN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Thô-ma tamóh Ađó: “Chuôq ơơi, nôôq yi kah n'nal Amei dyơq vôôiq ađó leq, nek ng'kơi nôôq yi ve chóóm n'nal kalơng đuôh?” <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó: “Thêi nek kalơng vôôiq, dhalam lơq parmông; kah ngaai chóóm tơk palơq Ama la kah đươi thêi. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />La adhi anó n'nal thêi, nek adhi anó kung n'nal Ama thêi. Tââq ađôk, adhi anó n'nal Ađó lơq ơi lêi Ađó.” <verse eid="JHN 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Phi-liip móón palơq Ađó: “Chuôq ơơi, nhan chaleq Ama đóng nôôq yi, kơi ađek nek dyóp đóng nôôq yi aq.” <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó: “Aku ơi tơơt palơq adhi anó mưi ganah đươnh kơi chêk hơq amei kah n'nal aku lua, Phi-liip? Ngaai đu ơi lêi aku nek ơi lêi Ama. Hau amei móón: ‘Nhan chaleq Ama leq nôôq yi’? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Amei kah huuiq kơi thêi tơơt kalóóng Ama, lơq Ama tơơt kalóóng thêi kơi? Nôôq paraaq đu thêi praaq palơq adhi anó nek eh tââq tư thêi yuur praaq, bơơi Ama taluôn mamông kalóóng thêi dyơq têêng tarnêêng ưng Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Phaai huuiq thêi, kơi thêi tơơt kalóóng Ama, lơq Ama tơơt kalóóng thêi; dyơq la kah, nek phaai huuiq ơi taai chênh nôôq tarnêêng ưng thêi. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Alua, alua, thêi praaq palơq adhi anó, ngaai đu huuiq leq thêi, nek manưih achêk kung e têêng nôôq tarnêêng đu thêi têêng; lơq e têêng nôôq tarnêêng gamak lơh kơi achêk, taai thêi ravang chô palơq Ama. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Tabhơt dhơ dharau hơq adhi anó vơn dhanóók thêi nhan gavơh, thêi e têêng rau ađek đóng, buôn Ama bâân bhi haanh tââq Akóón. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />La adhi anó vơn dhanóók thêi nhan thêi hau rau, thêi e têêng rau ađek. <verse eid="JHN 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />La adhi anó nh'nhơr aku, nek adhi anó e jư nôôq gani pachóóm ưng aku. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Thêi kung e nhan gavơh Ama, lơq Ađó e đóng leq adhi anó Yaang Bhơơl Lóóm lââng đóng Yaang achêk tơơt palơq adhi anó patơk nh'chró chró, <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />hơq nek Yaang Paraaq Dhalam, nek Yaang đu hóng katiêk kah chóóm đơơp đuôh, ơi taai hóng katiêk kah đơơp lêi Ađó, kung kah n'nal Ađó. Adhi anó nek n'nal Ađó, taai Ađó taluôn tơơt palơq adhi anó lơq e tơơt kalóóng adhi anó. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Thêi e kah lơơi adhi anó dharit mơ; Thêi tơk palơq adhi anó. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Dyơq m'bưưiq đươnh dyơq, hóng katiêk kah dyơq lêi thêi; bơơi adhi anó nek lêi thêi, taai thêi mamông, adhi anó kung e mamông. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Kalóóng tangêi ađek, adhi anó e n'nal kơi thêi tơơt kalóóng Ama thêi, adhi anó tơơt kalóóng thêi, lơq thêi kung tơơt kalóóng adhi anó. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Ngaai đu ve nôôq gani pachóóm ưng thêi lơq huuiq jư piđó, ađek nek manưih nh'nhơr thêi; lơq manưih nh'nhơr thêi e bâân Ama thêi nh'nhơr; thêi kung e nh'nhơr manưih ađek lơq pakah chênh thêi đóng manưih ađek.” <verse eid="JHN 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Ju-đa (eh rau nek Ich-ka-ri-ôôt) móón palơq Ađó: “Chuôq ơơi, harau chiên ơi vaaih đu Amei kanóq pakah leq Amei đóng nôôq yi hơq kah đóng manưih hóng katiêk?” <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi bóóp lơq Chuôq praaq palơq ađó: “La ngaai đu nh'nhơr thêi, nek manưih achêk e xâng jư paraaq thêi. Ama thêi e nh'nhơr manưih ađek; lơq Nôôq He e tơk palơq manưih ađek, hayơq têêng vaaih mưi dhiq tơơt jaq kalóóng manưih ađek. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Manưih kah nh'nhơr thêi nek kah huuiq jư paraaq thêi. Paraaq đu adhi anó xâng eh rau nek ưng thêi, hơq nek ưng Ama, Yaang đu kayua thêi.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Xók bhêêl biêh dyơq tơơt palơq adhi anó, thêi ơi praaq palơq adhi anó nôôq rau ađô. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Dhơ kơi ađek, Yaang Bhơơl Lóóm — nek Chuôq Yaang Liêm đu Ama e vơn dhanóók thêi kayua tơk — Yaang achêk e pachóóm kayua adhi anó dyóp tarnêêng lơq pahei lóóiq đóng adhi anó dyóp rau đu thêi ơi praaq palơq adhi anó. <verse eid="JHN 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />Thêi lơơi lóóiq leq adhi anó yươq rau ha; thêi đóng yươq rau ha ưng thêi leq adhi anó, thêi đóng leq adhi anó kah kơi manưih hóng katiêk đóng. Lóóm adhi anó óóq rau nhok nhói, kung óóq kakhin kapơn. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Adhi anó biêh xâng kơi thêi ơi praaq palơq adhi anó: ‘Thêi yuur vôôiq, hayơq thêi e val palơq adhi anó.’ La adhi anó nh'nhơr thêi, adhi anó alua dhakơi bâân bhuui marhaal xók thêi yuur chô paleq Ama, taai Ama dyơq bhi chap lơh thêi. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Xók ađôk, thêi ơi praaq loom tarnêêng vaaih tơk leq adhi anó, đóng xók tarnêêng vaaih tơk nek adhi anó ve lóóm huuiq. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Thêi e kah praaq kơơq bơk rau palơq adhi anó dyơq, taai đu kadhâng akoq manưih hóng katiêk ađô dyơq bhral. Lơq ađó kah ve rau phơn dhiq thêi, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />bơơi đóng manưih hóng katiêk bâân n'nal kơi thêi nh'nhơr Ama, lơq Ama ơi truuih pachóóm leq thêi ng'kơi, nek thêi yuur têêng i kơi achêk. Phaai yuur dyương, nôôq he kơng vôôiq lơh tââq ađôk.”<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />“Thêi nek tââm nho lalua, lơq Ama thêi nek manưih choh nho. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Xók n'đó đóóng kalóóng thêi kah bóóng pale, nek Ađó têch m'peq ađó; dyơq n'đó đóóng bóóng pale, nek Ađó chapech dhoon đóóng achêk đóng ađó ve chóóm bóóng pale bơk lơh. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Adhi anó bâân sek aq ve paraaq đu thêi ơi truuih đóng adhi anó. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Phaai bhiêk tơơt kalóóng thêi, lơq thêi kalóóng adhi anó. N'đó kơi đóóng nho kah ve chóóm đuôh tư ađó bóóng pale la ađó kah bhiêk tơơt kalóóng tââm nho, nek kung kơi achêk, adhi anó kah chóóm tư ađêi bóóng pale la adhi anó kah bhiêk tơơt kalóóng thêi. <verse eid="JHN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />Thêi nek tââm nho; adhi anó nek đóóng. Ngaai bhiêk tơơt kalóóng thêi, lơq thêi kalóóng ađó, nek manưih achêk bóóng pale bơk, ơi taai taklah bil tââq thêi, adhi anó kah ve chóóm rau têêng đuôh. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />La ngaai kah bhiêk tơơt kalóóng thêi, nek ađó achêk bâân m'peq lơơi leq nguôi thê kơi đóóng bâân rang; palââng chââih karong piđó lơq m'peq leq óih, hayơq piđó bâân róh bhơt. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />La adhi anó bhiêk tơơt kalóóng thêi, lơq paraaq thêi bhiêk tơơt kalóóng adhi anó, phaai nhan rau hau ađêi kiêng, nek rau ađek e bâân têêng đóng adhi anó. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Ama thêi bâân bhi haanh kalóóng rau ađô, achêk nek adhi anó bóóng pale bơk lơq adhi anó val xar môôn-đô ưng thêi. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Ama ơi nh'nhơr thêi ng'kơi, thêi kung nh'nhơr adhi anó kơi achêk. Phaai bhiêk tơơt kalóóng lóóm tanhơr ưng thêi. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />La adhi anó jư nôôq gani pachóóm ưng thêi, nek adhi anó e bhiêk tơơt kalóóng tanhơr ưng thêi, thê kơi thêi ơi jư nôôq gani pachóóm ưng Ama lơq bhiêk tơơt kalóóng tanhơr ưng Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Thêi ơi praaq nôôq rau đôk đóng adhi anó, buôn lóóm marhaal ưng thêi tơơt kalóóng adhi anó, lơq lóóm marhaal ưng adhi anó bâân bing dyóp. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Ađôk nek gani pachóóm ưng thêi, achêk nek adhi anó tanhơr xóng ađêi kơi thêi ơi nh'nhơr adhi anó. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Kah ngaai ve lóóm nh'nhơr gamak lơh kơi ađô — ađek nek mưi nak đơơp chêt parmông ađêi klóóih đóng nôôq parjơơk ưng ađó achêk. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Adhi anó nek parjơơk liêm ưng thêi la adhi anó têêng nôôq rau thêi truuih pachóóm đóng adhi anó. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Thêi kah đóók adhi anó nek dhơn ratơơq dyơq, taai dhơn ratơơq kah n'nal tarnêêng kala ađêi têêng. Bơơi thêi ơi đóók adhi anó nek parjơơk liêm, taai dyóp tarnêêng đu thêi ơi xâng tââq Ama thêi, nek thêi pakah đóng adhi anó n'nal. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Eh rau adhi anó ơi chââih thêi, bơơi thêi ơi chââih adhi anó lơq patóóng kayua adhi anó, buôn adhi anó vôôiq, bóóng pale, lơq pale ưng adhi anó bâân dyơq lóóiq, đóng dhơ dharau đu adhi anó vơn dhanóók thêi nhan gavơh Ama, nek Ađó đóng leq adhi anó. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Thêi truuih pachóóm đóng adhi anó nôôq paraaq ađô, buôn đóng adhi anó tanhơr xóng ađêi. <verse eid="JHN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />La hóng katiêk geet adhi anó, nek phaai n'nal kơi hóng katiêk ơi geet aku laloom adhi anó. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />La adhi anó mađó leq manưih hóng katiêk, nek manưih hóng katiêk alua dhakơi ơi nh'nhơr manưih mađó leq ađó. Bơơi taai adhi anó kah mađó leq manưih hóng katiêk, hơq palâh lóóiq, thêi ơi chââih adhi anó tââq m'pơng manưih hóng katiêk, taai ađek manưih hóng katiêk geet adhi anó. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Phaai hei lóóiq paraaq đu aku ơi praaq palơq adhi anó: ‘Dhơn ratơơq nek kah gamak lơh kala ưng ađêi.’ La piđó m'bhiiq vei thêi, nek piđó kung e m'bhiiq vei adhi anó; la piđó jư paraaq thêi, nek piđó kung e jư paraaq ưng adhi anó. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Bơơi ơi taai dhanóók ưng thêi, piđó e têêng dyóp tarnêêng achêk palơq adhi anó, taai piđó kah ve đơơp n'nal Yaang đu kayua thêi. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />La thêi kah tơk lơq praaq truuih đóng piđó, nek piđó kah ve matu; bơơi xók đôk, piđó kah dyơq chóóm kadrêi palââp đóng matu lơt ưng chênh piđó. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Manưih geet thêi nek kung geet Ama thêi. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />La thêi ơi kah têêng m'pơng piđó nôôq tarnêêng đu kah ve ngaai lââng chóóm têêng, nek piđó kah ve matu; bơơi xók đôk piđó ơi lêi hayơq dyơq geet bhơt thêi palơq Ama thêi. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Dhơ kơi ađek, achêk nek lơơi đóng bâân tajaap paraaq bâân xaraq kalóóng gani ưng piđó, kơi ađô: ‘Kah rauriq piđó geet thêi.’ <verse eid="JHN 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />Xók Yaang Bhơơl Lóóm tơk, hơq nek Yaang tââq dhiq Ama đu thêi e kayua tơk đóng adhi anó — nek Yaang Dhalam gluh tââq Ama — Ađó e truuih đuui leq thêi. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Hơq adhi anó kung truuih đuui dyơq, taai adhi anó tơơt palơq thêi tư tââq tarnââp.”<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />“Thêi ơi praaq nôôq rau ađek leq adhi anó, đóng adhi anó yươq n'đóih m'bhuôh. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Piđó e têêng đóng adhi anó bâân tapagluh tââq gươl. Kơi achêk hơq ganah tangêi ravang tơk nek pakoom đóng dyóp ngaai leng karchêt adhi anó ngóq nek ađêi dyơq tapôông bhanuôih bhuôih haanh leq Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Piđó e têêng nôôq tarnêêng achêk taai piđó kah n'nal Ama, kung kah n'nal thêi. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Dhơ kơi achêk, thêi ơi praaq nôôq rau ađô leq adhi anó đóng xók tangêi ganah ưng kabhuh piđó tơk, adhi anó hei lóóiq nôôq paraaq đu thêi ơi truuih leq adhi anó. Kơi lââng, thêi kah truuih nôôq rau ađô leq adhi anó tư tââq tarnââp taai thêi biêh dyơq tơơt palơq adhi anó. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Dyơq xók ađôk thêi vôôiq tơk Yaang đu kayua thêi, lơq kah ngaai kalóóng adhi anó tamóh thêi: ‘Thêi dyơq vôôiq n'leq?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Palâh lóóiq, rau ranguôq rangóót ơi buur bing luônh lóóm ưng adhi anó taai thêi ơi praaq palơq adhi anó nôôq rau ađô. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Dhơ kơi ađek, thêi praaq rau lalua palơq adhi anó, thêi yuur vôôiq achêk nek rau đââng malơơi malaai đóng adhi anó. Taai la thêi kah yuur vôôiq, nek Yaang Bhơơl Lóóm e kah tơk palơq adhi anó. Dyơq la thêi vôôiq, nek thêi e kayua Yaang achêk tơk palơq adhi anó. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Xók ơi tơk, Yaang achêk e pakah manưih hóng katiêk leq matu lơt, leq rau bhơt liêm, lơq leq rau xêi xanêi — <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />leq matu lơt, nek taai piđó kah huuiq dhiq aku; <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />leq rau bhơt liêm, nek taai thêi chô paleq Ama, hayơq adhi anó e kah ve lêi thêi dyơq; <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />dyơq leq rau xêi xanêi, nek taai manưih têêng kala hóng katiêk ađô ơi bâân taxêi. <verse eid="JHN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />Thêi ve bơk rau lơh đóng praaq palơq adhi anó, bơơi xók đôk adhi anó kah đuôh chóóm n'nal bhơt. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Bơơi xók Yaang achêk, nek Yaang Liêm Paraaq Dhalam tơk, Ađó e kađââng adhi anó mót kalóóng dyóp paraaq dhalam; taai Ađó kah tư ađêi e yuur praaq, hơq Ađó e praaq bhơt dhơ dharau Ađó xâng, lơq Ađó e truuih móón đóng adhi anó nôôq tarnêêng dyơq vaaih tơk. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Yaang achêk e bhi haanh thêi, taai Ađó e pei đơơp nôôq rau tââq dhiq thêi hayơq e praaq pakah đóng adhi anó. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Dyóp rau, bhơt dhơ dharau nôôq Ama ve, nek mađó leq thêi. Taai kơi achêk, thêi praaq kơi, Yaang achêk e pei đơơp nôôq rau ưng thêi lơq pakah đóng adhi anó. <verse eid="JHN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />Kalóóng m'bưưiq đươnh dyơq, adhi anó kah dyơq lêi thêi, hayơq vil tatun m'bưưiq đươnh, adhi anó e lêi thêi.” <verse eid="JHN 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Xong ađek, bơơr pe nak kalóóng nôôq môôn-đô Ađó praaq palơq xóng ađêi: “Tarnêêng ađô nek ng'kơi dhơq xók thêi praaq palơq nôôq he kơi ađô: ‘Kalóóng m'bưưiq đươnh dyơq adhi anó kah lêi thêi, hayơq vil tatun m'bưưiq đươnh, adhi anó e lêi thêi’ lơq: ‘Taai aku chô paleq Ama’?” <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Taai ađek, piđó móón: “‘M'bưưiq đươnh’ kiêng móón nek ng'kơi? Nôôq he kah n'nal rau thêi dyơq praaq.” <verse eid="JHN 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Chuôq Jê-su n'nal kơi piđó kiêng tamóh Ađó, hơq Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Kah alua adhi anó dyơq tư ađêi tabâân n'nal leq paraaq đu thêi ơi praaq: ‘Kalóóng m'bưưiq đươnh dyơq, adhi anó kah lêi thêi, hayơq vil tatun m'bưưiq đươnh, adhi anó e lêi thêi’? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Alua, alua, thêi praaq palơq adhi anó kơi adhi anó e nhiim griit, m'bhoonh, dyơq manưih hóng katiêk e bhuui sương. Adhi anó e ranguôq rangóót, bơơi rau ranguôq rangóót ưng adhi anó e vaaih xar rau bhuui marhaal. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />La bhêêl manưih pađiil n'niên akóón nek ve galuh ka-ai karuôq taai jơ ađêi ơi tơk, bơơi xók ơi bâân n'niên akóón paniên, ađó yươq dyơq hei tơk galuh kadhaap jarnah ưng ađêi dyơq, ơi taai lóóm marhaal taai mưi nak ve bâân n'niên dhiq hóng katiêk. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Kung kơi achêk, xók đôk adhi anó ve rau ranguôq rangóót, bơơi thêi e lum lóóiq adhi anó; hayơq lóóm adhi anó e bâân bhuui sương, lơq kah ngaai chóóm pei paxooq lóóm marhaal ưng adhi anó tââq adhi anó. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Mót tangêi ađek adhi anó e kah tamóh thêi dhơ dharau. Alua, alua, thêi praaq palơq adhi anó, tabhơt dhơ dharau adhi anó gavơh nhan Ama vơn dhanóók thêi, Ađó e đóng leq adhi anó. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Patơk ađôk, adhi anó kah ơi nhan gavơh dhơ dharau vơn dhanóók thêi. Phaai gavơh nhan aq, nek adhi anó e bâân đơơp, đóng lóóm marhaal ưng adhi anó bâân dyóp liêm.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />Thêi ơi praaq nôôq rau đôk palơq adhi anó palơq nôôq paraaq babi, xók tangêi ganah tơk, thêi e kah dyơq praaq palơq adhi anó palơq nôôq paraaq babi dyơq, klóóih leq ađek, thêi e pakah đóng adhi anó kơi drêh dróói leq Ama. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Kalóóng tangêi ađek, adhi anó e gavơh nhan vơn dhanóók thêi, lơq thêi kah praaq palơq adhi anó kơi thêi e gavơh nhan Ama klóóih đóng adhi anó, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />Taai chênh Ama nh'nhơr adhi anó, taai adhi anó nh'nhơr thêi lơq huuiq kơi thêi ơi tơk tââq Ama. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Thêi ơi bhral tââq Ama lơq ơi mót kalóóng hóng katiêk. Hayơq thêi vil xooq tââq hóng katiêk lơq vôôiq tơk paleq Ama.” <verse eid="JHN 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Nôôq môôn-đô ưng Ađó móón: “Lêi tôôh, xók đôk thêi dyơq praaq kơi drêh dróói, hơq kah praaq palơq paraaq babi. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Bhêêl đôk, nôôq yi n'nal kơi thêi bhluuch n'nal dyóp rau, lơq kah kơng phaai ve ngaai tamóh thêi. Tââq ađek, nôôq yi huuiq kơi thêi ơi bhral tââq Yaang Pleng.” <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi bóóp piđó: “Xók đôk adhi anó ve huuiq kah? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Nek lêi, ađôk dyơq tơk — lơq ơi tơk — nek adhi anó bâân xooq gloong, dyóp chanak ting kalơng n'tua ađêi, dyơq thêi nek adhi anó lơơi lóóiq mưi ađêi. Dhơ kơi achêk, thêi yươq glêh bâân tơơt laleh, taai Ama tơơt palơq thêi. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Thêi ơi praaq nôôq rau ađô đóng adhi anó buôn đóng adhi anó ve yươq rau ha dhiq thêi. Adhi anó lum bhrê hư kalóóng hóng katiêk, bơơi phaai mưng lóóm, thêi ơi đươk hóng katiêk aq.”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq nôôq paraaq achêk hayơq chaling mat leq Pleng, Ađó praaq: “Kakoh Ama, jơ ơi tơk. Nhan têêng cha-iil tabah Akóón ưng Ama, đóng Akóón ve chóóm têêng cha-iil tabah Ama, <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />taai Ama ơi đóng leq Akóón mataai karơ dhiq dyóp rau achak araang, đóng nôôq ngaai đu Ama ơi pajaau đóng Akóón, nek Akóón đóng leq nôôq manưih achêk rau parmông nh'chró chró. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Dyơq ađô nek rau parmông nh'chró chró, chênh nek đóng nôôq manưih achêk đơơp n'nal Ama, Yaang Pleng lalua dhalam mưi giêl, lơq Chuôq Paq Manưih Jê-su, nek Yaang Ama ơi kayua tơk. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Akóón ơi têêng cha-iil tabah Ama dhiq katiêk, têêng paxong tarnêêng đu Ama ơi pajaau đóng Akóón đóng Akóón têêng. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Ama ơơi, xók đôk nhan Ama têêng cha-iil tabah Akóón toom mat Ama palơq rau cha-iil tabah đu Akóón biêh ve tóór Ama xók kah ơi hóng katiêk avaaih. <verse eid="JHN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />Akóón ơi pakah dhanóók Ama leq nôôq manưih đu Ama ơi pajaau đóng Akóón m'pơng hóng katiêk. Piđó mađó leq Ama, Ama pajaau piđó leq Akóón, lơq piđó ơi pei jư paraaq Ama. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Xók ađôk, piđó ơi n'nal kơi tabhơt dyóp rau Ama ơi đóng leq Akóón nek tââq Ama, <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />taai Akóón ơi đóng leq piđó nôôq paraaq đu Ama ơi đóng leq Akóón. Piđó đơơp nôôq paraaq achêk lơq lalua n'nal kơi Akóón tơk tââq Ama, lơq piđó huuiq kơi chênh Ama ơi kayua Akóón. <verse eid="JHN 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />Akóón gavơh nhan đóng piđó. Akóón kah gavơh nhan đóng hóng katiêk, bơơi nek đóng nôôq manưih đu Ama ơi pajaau leq Akóón, taai piđó mađó leq Ama. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Tabhơt ưng Akóón nek ưng Ama; kung kơi ưng Ama nek ưng Akóón, lơq Akóón bâân cha-iil tabah dhiq m'pơng piđó. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Akóón kah tơơt kalóóng hóng katiêk dyơq, hơq piđó tơơt kalóóng hóng katiêk, dyơq Akóón chô palơq Ama. Kakoh Ama Tabah Liêm, nhan jư lêi piđó kalóóng dhanóók Ama đu Ama ơi đóng leq Akóón, đóng piđó ve chóóm xar mưi, kơi Nôôq He. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Dyơq xók Akóón dyơq tơơt palơq piđó, Akóón jư lêi piđó kalóóng dhanóók Ama đu Ama ơi đóng leq Akóón. Akóón ơi jư lêi piđó hơq yươq manak manâ kalóóng nôôq piđó bâân chêt bil, chapiên panong akóón ưng rau hư bil, đóng paraaq Yaang Pleng bâân tajaap. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Bơơi xók đôk, Akóón chô palơq Ama, lơq akóón praaq nôôq rau ađô kalóóng hóng katiêk đóng piđó ve lóóm marhaal ưng Akóón bâân dyóp liêm kalóóng piđó. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Akóón ơi đóng paraaq Ama leq piđó, lơq manưih hóng katiêk geet piđó taai piđó kah mađó leq manưih hóng katiêk, kung kơi Akóón kah mađó leq manưih hóng katiêk. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Akóón kah gavơh nhan đóng Ama pagluh piđó gluh tââq hóng katiêk, bơơi nek đóng Ama jư lêi piđó tââq đu aak. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Piđó kah mađó leq hóng katiêk, kung kơi Akóón kah mađó leq hóng katiêk. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Nhan Ama têêng pasek piđó palơq praaq dhalam, paraaq Ama nek paraaq dhalam. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Ama ơi kayua Akóón mót kalóóng hóng katiêk ng'kơi, nek Akóón kung kayua piđó mót kalóóng hóng katiêk kơi achêk. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Ơi taai piđó Akóón ơi tư têêng liêm tabah, đóng chênh piđó kung bâân liêm tabah kalóóng paraaq dhalam. <verse eid="JHN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />Bơơi Akóón kah chapiên gavơh nhan đóng nôôq manưih ađô, hơq dyơq đóng nôôq ngaai huuiq tââq Akóón dhiq paraaq ưng piđó dyơq, <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />đóng tabhơt piđó val xar mưi, kơi Ama kalóóng Akóón lơq Akóón kalóóng Ama, buôn đóng piđó kung tơơt kalóóng Nôôq He, đóng manưih hóng katiêk huuiq kơi Ama ơi kayua Akóón tơk. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Cha-iil tabah đu Ama ơi đóng leq Akóón, nek Akóón kung đóng leq piđó, buôn piđó ve chóóm nek mưi, kơi Nôôq He nek mưi; <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Akóón tơơt kalóóng piđó, lơq Ama tơơt kalóóng Akóón buôn đóng piđó bâân dyóp liêm val xar mưi, đóng manưih hóng katiêk n'nal kơi Ama ơi kayua Akóón tơk, lơq Ama ơi nh'nhơr piđó kơi Ama ơi nh'nhơr Akóón. <verse eid="JHN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />Ama ơơi, ngaai manưih hơq Ama ơi pajaau đóng Akóón, Akóón kiêng kơi n'dhiq Akóón tơơt nek piđó kung tơơt dhiq ađek palơq Akóón, đóng móng lêi cha-iil tabah ưng Akóón, nek cha-iil tabah Ama ơi đóng leq Akóón, taai Ama ơi nh'nhơr Akóón xók kah ơi tavaaih hóng katiêk. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Ama Bhơt Liêm ơơi, dhơ nek manưih hóng katiêk kah n'nal Ama, bơơi Akóón n'nal Ama; lơq nôôq manưih ađô n'nal kơi Ama ơi kayua Akóón tơk. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Akóón ơi pakah dhanóók Ama đóng piđó, lơq Akóón e pakah dyơq, đóng lóóm nh'nhơr đu Ama ơi nh'nhơr Akóón tơơt kalóóng piđó, lơq Akóón kung tơơt kalóóng piđó.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Xók ơi praaq xong nôôq paraaq achêk, Chuôq Jê-su vôôiq gluh palơq nôôq môôn-đô ađêi chaang hót tôôh tóm Kêêt-rôôn, hơq dhiq ađô ve mưi dham bhươn, Ađó palơq nôôq môôn-đô ađêi vôôiq mót kalóóng ađek. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Xók achêk, Ju-đa, manưih mangê tamôôp Ađó, kung n'nal dhiq ađô, taai chuôq Jê-su biêh karong hoop dhiq ađôk palơq nôôq môôn-đô ađêi. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Taai kơi achêk, Ju-đa tơk dhiq ađek, đââng ting mưi kabhuh linh palơq kabhuh linh đương jư tââq dhiq nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm lơq tââq nôôq manưih Pha-ri-si, đââng lơq dhơu, dharương lơq kóóih bhươt. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Bhêêl ađek, taai Chuôq Jê-su n'nal dyóp tarnêêng ravang vaaih tơk leq ađêi, hơq xók jađaang gluh, Ađó tamóh piđó: “Nôôq pe chik chêk ngaai?” <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Piđó ââi bóóp Ađó: “Jê-su manưih Na-xa-reet.” Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Chênh nek Aku.” (Xók achêk, Ju-đa, manưih baan Ađó kung dyơq dyương palơq kabhuh piđó.) <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Kơi achêk hayơq, xók Ađó ơi praaq palơq piđó: “Chênh nek Aku,” nek piđó róch leq hót hóng lơq kalơm leq katiêk. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Xong ađek, Ađó vil tamóh piđó: “Nôôq pe chik chêk ngaai?” Hayơq piđó móón: “Jê-su manưih Na-xa-reet.” <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi: “Aku ơi móón palơq nôôq pe kơi chênh nek aku. Kơi achêk hayơq, la nôôq pe dyơq chik chêk aku nek phaai đóng nôôq piđó ađô vôôiq.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />(Achêk nek đóng bâân tajaap paraaq đu Ađó ơi praaq kơi ađô: “Leq nôôq manưih Ama ơi pajaau đóng Akóón, Akóón kah têêng tabil mưi ngaai kalóóng nôôq piđó.”) <verse eid="JHN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Bhêêl achêk, xók dyơq ve mưi pala bhươt, Si-môôn Phi-e-rơ, thuôt ađó gluh, hayơq ruul viêng manưih dhơn ratơơq ưng takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm lơq chapech tatươt katór tươm ưng manưih ađô. Achak manưih dhơn ratơơq nek Maan-chu. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Kơi achêk hayơq Chuôq Jê-su yua Phi-e-rơ: “Phaai tamót bhươt leq kalóóng xóór! Choom đu Ama ơi đóng leq thêi, thêi ve chóóm kah kơng ơm ađó alua?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Xong ađek, kabhuh linh lơq manưih đââng akoq, palơq kabhuh linh đương jư ưng manưih Jo Thaaiq kóóp jư Chuôq Jê-su lơq klooiq Ađó lóóiq. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Laloom tââm, piđó đââng Ađó tơk An-ne, taai abhươp achêk nek akonh kađiêl ưng Kaai-phe, hơq Kaai-phe nek takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm kalóóng kamó ađek. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />(Kơi lââng, Kaai-phe nek manưih ơi pahêêl manưih Jo Thaaiq kơi alua nek liêm lơh xók mưi nak chêt klóóih đóng tabhơt dhanuôr.)<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Xók achêk, Si-môôn Phi-e-rơ lơq mưi môôn-đô lââng vôôiq ting Chuôq Jê-su. Bơơi môôn-đô ađek biêh ve bâân keen n'nal palơq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm, hơq manưih achêk vôôiq palơq Chuôq Jê-su mót kalóóng taang đong ưng takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Dyơq Phi-e-rơ bhiêk dyương dhiq palóng hót nguôi, kơi achêk hơq môôn-đô tôôh, nek manưih ve bâân keen n'nal palơq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm, vôôiq gluh móón palơq pađiil đương palóng, hayơq đââng Phi-e-rơ mót. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Xong ađek, pađiil dhơn ratơơq nek manưih đương palóng, móón palơq Phi-e-rơ: “Kah alua amei kung tơơt kalóóng kabhuh nôôq môôn-đô ưng manưih ađô?” Ađó ââi: “Eh rau aku.” <verse eid="JHN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Xók achêk, nôôq dhơn ratơơq lơq kabhuh linh đương jư dyơq dyương dhiq ađek, yuur padyunh mưi garboq óih rahââng taai pleng khau, lơq piđó dyơq tư haang ngan. Phi-e-rơ kung tơơt palơq piđó, dyương dhiq ađek lơq tư haang ngan.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Xók achêk, takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm tamóh Chuôq Jê-su leq nôôq môôn-đô Ađó lơq leq rau taruuih pachóóm ưng Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi bóóp ađó ađek: “Aku ơi praaq kơi kah pađơp đóng dyóp ngaai. Aku taluôn truuih pachóóm kalóóng gươl lơq kalóóng đong bhanuôih, nek dhiq dyóp manưih Jo Thaaiq nhoom karong palơq xóng piđó, lơq Aku kah praaq rau kadrêi palââp bhơt. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Hau amei tamóh aku? Phaai tamóh nôôq manưih ơi xâng paraaq đu aku ơi praaq palơq piđó. Lêi tôôh, nôôq manưih achêk n'nal aku ơi praaq hau rau.” <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Xók Ađó praaq kơi achêk, nek mưi nak kalóóng kabhuh linh đương jư dyơq dyương dhiq ađek đóng Chuôq Jê-su mưi paleh m'pah, móón kơi ađô: “Amei ââi bóóp takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm chêk kơi alua?” <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi bóóp ađó: “La aku praaq lơt, nek chaleq n'đó dhiq lơt achêk. Dyơq la nek pâng, taai hau amei m'pah aku?” <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Hayơq xók biêh dyơq taklooiq, An-ne đóng đââng Ađó vôôiq tơk takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm Kaai-phe.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Xók achêk, Si-môôn Phi-e-rơ bhiêk dyơq dyương lơq tư haang ngan. Kơi achêk hayơq, palââng móón palơq ađó: “Kah alua amei kung tơơt kalóóng kabhuh nôôq môôn-đô ưng manưih ađek alua?” Phi-e-rơ dyiin lơq ââi: “Eh rau aku.” <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Mưi nak kalóóng kabhuh nôôq dhơn ratơơq ưng takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm, nek bhuh xóng palơq manưih đu Phi-e-rơ ơi têch kakut katór, móón: “kah alua aku ơi lêi amei tơơt kalóóng bhươn palơq manưih ađek alua?” <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Kơi achêk nek Phi-e-rơ dyiin machu dyơq, hayơq n'drươh nek atưưch takar.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Tââq ađek, piđó đââng Chuôq Jê-su tââq dhiq Kaai-phe tơk đong takóh kadhâng dhanuôr. (Xók achêk, bhêêl dyơq yayóng yayương, piđó kah vôôiq mót kalóóng đong takóh kadhâng dhanuôr đóng piđó óóq bâân anhuq, hơq đươi kơi achêk piđó ve chóóm bâân cha Bhiêk Jalơh.) <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Kơi achêk hơq, Phi-laat ơi vôôiq gluh lum piđó lơq móón: “Nôôq pe ting đââng hau rau paraaq kaauq patu jơl lóóiq manưih ađô?” <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Piđó ââi lóóiq lơq móón palơq ađó: “La manưih ađô kah ve têêng rau lơt aak, nek alua dhakơi nôôq yi ơi kah pajaau đââng ađó leq kuôn.” <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Taai kơi achêk, Phi-laat praaq palơq piđó: “Nôôq pe phaai đââng manưih ađô chô hayơq xêi ađó ting gani ưng nôôq pe.” Manưih Jo Thaaiq móón palơq ađó ađek: “Kah ve pheep đóng nôôq yi karchêt dhơ dhangaai.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />(Achêk nek đóng tajaap paraaq Chuôq Jê-su, hơq Ađó ơi praaq đóng chaleq leq kar chêt ng'kơi Ađó ravang phaai đơơp)<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Kơi achêk nek Phi-laat vil chô mót kalóóng đong takóh kadhâng dhanuôr, lơq yua dhaloong Chuôq Jê-su tơk hayơq Phi-laat móón palơq Ađó: “Amei ve alua nek Bhua dhanuôr Jo Thaaiq?” <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi lóóiq: “Amei tư ađêi praaq rau ađô môôiq ngaai lââng ơi móón đóng amei leq aku?” <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Phi-laat ââi bóóp: “Aku ve alua nek manưih Jo Thaaiq dhơq? Chênh manưih dhanuôr ưng amei lơq nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm pajaau đââng amei leq aku. Amei ơi têêng hau rau?” <verse eid="JHN 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi bóóp: “Katiêk ưng aku kah mađó leq hóng katiêk ađô. La katiêk ưng aku mađó leq hóng katiêk ađô, nek alua dhakơi nôôq dhơn ratơơq ưng aku ơi tarjơl đóng aku yươq bâân pajaau đââng leq manưih Jo Thaaiq. Bơơi xók đôk katiêk ưng aku kah tơơt dhiq ađô.” <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Kơi achêk hayơq Phi-laat móón palơq Ađó: “Kơi achêk ve alua amei nek bhua?” Chuôq Jê-su ââi: “Amei móón kơi aku nek bhua. Aku ơi bâân n'niên taai rau ađô, lơq aku ơi tơk kalóóng hóng katiêk kung taai rau ađek, achêk nek đóng truuih đuui leq paraaq dhalam, Ngaai đu mađó leq paraaq dhalam nek xâng dhariêng ưng aku.” <verse eid="JHN 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Phi-laat móón palơq Ađó: “Paraaq dhalam nek harau?” Praaq xong paraaq achêk, Phi-laat vil vôôiq gluh lum manưih Jo Thaaiq lơq móón palơq piđó: “Aku kah ve lêi rau matu lơt dhiq manưih ađô. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Dhơ kơi ađek, ting kơi kaxu ưng nôôq pe nek aku paloh đóng nôôq pe mưi nak mót tangêi Bhiêk Jalơh. Kơi achêk, nôôq pe kiêng aku paloh Bhua ưng manưih Jo Thaaiq đóng nôôq pe kah?” <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Kơi achêk hayơq piđó vil yuur lalơu, kơi ađô: “Eh rau ađó ađô, hơq nek Ba-ra-ba.” Xók achêk, Ba-ra-ba nek mưi nak tatông.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Kơi chêk, dhalam xók ađek, Phi-laat đóng kóóp Chuôq Jê-su lơq m'bhiiq Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Nôôq linh taanh mưi beq panơơng palơq axông. Piđó tapơơng leq koq Ađó, lơq paxơp đóng leq Ađó mưi beq aau yaal parhóm bhrôông ga-ong. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Piđó tơk toom Ađó lơq móón: “Nhan chap yayar Bhua dhanuôr Jo Thaaiq!” hayơq đóng Ađó bơơr pe paleh m'pah. <verse eid="JHN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Mưi chu dyơq, Phi-laat vôôiq gluh lơq praaq palơq piđó: “Lêi nô, aku đââng manưih ađô gluh đóng nôôq pe đóng nôôq pe n'nal kơi aku kah bâân lêi rau matu lơt dhiq ađó ađô.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Hayơq Chuôq Jê-su vôôiq gluh, pơơng panơơng axông lơq xơp aau bhrôông ga-ong. Phi-laat móón palơq piđó: “Phaai lêi manưih ađô nek!” <verse eid="JHN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Kơi achêk nek, xók bhêêl nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm lơq kabhuh linh đương jư lêi Ađó, piđó lalơu karơ kơi ađô: “Teeng đinh ađó dhiq n'lóóng m'baang chatông! Teeng đinh Ađó dhiq n'lóóng m'baang chatông!” Phi-laat yua piđó: “Nôôq pe phaai tư kóóp ađó ađek lơq teeng đinh, taai aku kah bâân lêi ve matu lơt dhiq ađó ađek.” <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Manưih Jo Thaaiq ââi palơq Phi-laat: “Nôôq yi ve gani lơq ting kơi gani ađek, nek ađó phaai chêt taai ađó tư móón ađêi nek Akóón Yaang Pleng.” <verse eid="JHN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Taai ađek, xók Phi-laat xâng paraaq ađô, ađó ađek tatrul kơơq kakhin kapơn, <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />ađó vil vôôiq mót kalóóng đong takóh kadhâng dhanuôr lơq móón palơq Chuôq Jê-su: “Amei n'đó tââq bhral?” Bơơi Chuôq Jê-su kah ââi đóng ađó ađek marau marâ. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Taai kơi achêk, Phi-laat móón palơq Ađó: “Amei kah ââi bóóp aku? Amei kah n'nal kơi aku ve kataai paloh amei, lơq kung ve kataai teeng đinh amei dhiq n'lóóng m'baang chatông?” <verse eid="JHN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi lóóiq ađó ađek: “Amei kah ve kataai dhơ dharau nek palơq Aku, la kataai achêk ơi kah bâân đóng leq amei tââq m'piing yaal. Taai rau ađek, đu đââng pajaau aku leq amei ve matu haleng lơh.” <verse eid="JHN 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Tââq paraaq achêk, Phi-laat tabâân kơi paloh Ađó, bơơi manưih Jo Thaaiq lalơu karơ kơi ađô: “La kuôn paloh ađó kuôn eh rau nek parjơơk ưng Sê-sa: Ngaai tư hayuur ađêi têêng bhua nek tarjơl palơq Sê-sa.” <verse eid="JHN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Taai ađek, xong xók xâng nôôq paraaq ađô, Phi-laat đóng đââng Chuôq Jê-su gluh leq nguôi hayơq ađó tơơt dhiq tanơơt xêi xanêi dhiq dham bâân đóók nek “Đong Bhanơn Dhơl” Dyơq kalóóng dhariêng Hi-baaq-laai nek “Ga-ba-tha”. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />(Xók achêk nek tangêi ravang đóng Bhiêk Jalơh. Bhêêl achêk nek mơ jơ đu chapat.) Phi-laat móón palơq manưih Jo Thaaiq: “Lêi aq, bhua ưng nôôq pe!” <verse eid="JHN 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Bơơi piđó lalơu karơ: “Yông Ađó vóq! Yông ađó vóq! Teeng đinh ađó dhiq n'lóóng m'baang chatông!” Phi-laat tamóh piđó: “Aku teeng đinh bhua ưng nôôq pe kơi?” Nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm ââi: “Chapiên mưi Sê-sa, nôôq yi kah ve bhua.” <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Kơi achêk nek, xók bhêêl ađek, Phi-laat pajaau Ađó leq piđó đóng đơơp teeng đinh dhiq n'lóóng m'baang chatông. Hayơq piđó kóóp Chuôq Jê-su lơq đââng vôôiq.<verse eid="JHN 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Xók phaai tư đuôl n'lóóng m'baang chatông, Ađó vôôiq tơk dhiq bâân đóók nek “Dhiq Paliing Akoq”, dhiq ađek kalóóng dhariêng Hi-baaq-laai bâân đóók nek “Gô-gô-tha.” <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Palââng teeng đinh Ađó dhiq ađek, nek palơq Ađó bơơr nak lââng, tơơt hót ađô lơq hót tôôh, dyơq Chuôq Jê-su tơơt m'pơng. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Xók chêk, Phi-laat kung đóng xaraq mưi kalơng chư hayơq tabóq dhiq n'lóóng m'baang chatông. Kalơng chư bâân xaraq: JÊ-SU MANƯIH NA-XA-REET, BHUA DHANUÔR JO THAAIQ. <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Taai ađek, bơk manưih Jo Thaaiq chóóm đok kalơng chư ađô taai dhiq đu Chuôq Jê-su bâân tateeng đinh nek đan dhiq kanóón bhươh. Kalơng chư bâân xaraq palơq dhariêng Hi-baaq-laai, dhariêng La-tinh lơq dhariêng Hi-laap. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Taai kơi achêk, nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm manưih Jo Thaaiq móón palơq Phi-laat: “Nhan óóq xaraq nek ‘Bhua dhanuôr Jo Thaaiq,’ hơq xaraq nek ‘Ađó móón kơi “Aku nek Bhua dhanuôr Jo Thaaiq.”’” <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Phi-laat ââi: “Paraaq aku ơi xaraq, nek aku xong ơi xaraq.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Xong ađek, mót bhêêl kabhuh linh teeng đinh Chuôq Jê-su leq n'lóóng m'baang chatông, piđó pei aau ưng Ađó hayơq blah têêng puôn phơn — mưi nak linh mưi phơn — lơq aau yaal. Aau chêk nek kah ve kalơng par-ih, nek mưi tala bhaai ter tââq m'piing tơk n'raal. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Taai kơi achêk, piđó praaq palơq xóng piđó: “Óóq n'teek aau pahư, bơơi phaai dhơơch leq ađó, lêi ađó e nek ưng ngaai.” Achêk nek đóng paraaq Bha-aar Yaang Pleng bâân tajaap kơi ađô: “Piđó blah xóng piđó aau aku, thuôt padhơơch pei aau aku.” Kơi achêk nek, kabhuh linh ơi têêng kơi achêk.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Xók achêk, bơơi manưih dyơq dyương tóór n'lóóng m'baang chatông ưng Chuôq Jê-su nek amêêq ưng Ađó, lơq adhi anó ưng amêêq Ađó, nek Ma-ri kađiêl ưng Kơ-lê-ô-ba, palơq Ma-ri Ma-đơ-leen. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Kơi achêk nek, xók Chuôq Jê-su chalaang lêi amêêq ađêi lơq môôn-đô đu Ađó nh'nhơr dyương tóór ađek, nek Ađó praaq palơq amêêq: “Amêêq ơơi, lêi tôôh, akóón padruuih ưng amei!” <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Hayơq Ađó móón palơq manưih môôn-đô: “Lêi tôôh, amêêq ưng amei!” Tââq bhêêl ađek, môôn-đô achêk đââng ađó chô leq đong ađêi.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Xong ađek, taai Chuôq Jê-su n'nal kơi dyóp tarnêêng ơi bâân xong luch aq, nek hayơq đóng paraaq Bha-aar Yaang Pleng bâân tajaap, nek Ađó praaq: “Aku rahaal.” <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Mưi beq alooch kađôôq bing đơơk kadyuôq bâân patơơt dhiq ađek, taai kơi achêk, palơq kơi tabóq leq đóóng n'lóóng janươu mưi panuôl môôp bing đơơk kadyuôq, palââng đââng haluôch leq bóóp Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Kơi achêk, bhêêl Chuôq Jê-su kadyeep đơơk kadyuôq achêk, Ađó praaq: “Dyóp tarnêêng ơi bâân xong!” Hayơq ngói akoq chok leq, Ađó pat parhââm ađêi.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Xong tơk, taai vaar ađek nek tangêi ravang, đóng hayơq lơơi nôôq xaak manưih kah bhiêk tơơt dhiq m'baang chatông bhluuch tangêi Sa-baat (taai tangêi Sa-baat ađek nek mưi tangêi bhơt liêm), manưih Jo Thaaiq nhan Phi-laat đóng bâân têêng plak chakuông dyung ưng nôôq manưih ađek hayơq nôôq xaak ve chóóm bâân đââng patââi. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Taai kơi achêk, kabhuh linh vôôiq tơk lơq m'bhiiq plak chakuông dyung ưng manưih laloom tââm, hayơq ưng manưih đu bơơr, nek nôôq manưih pâng tateeng đinh palơq Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Bơơi xók tơk dhiq Chuôq Jê-su, piđó lêi Ađó ơi chêt aq, hơq kah m'bhiiq plak dyung Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Dhơ kơi ađek, mưi chanak kalóóng kabhuh linh tak hót naar Ađó palơq kóóih, hơq nek ahaam lơq đơơk hóói kabhruk. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Manưih ơi lêi tarnêêng achêk ơi truuih đuui lóóiq, lơq paraaq truuih ưng ađó ađô nek lalua dhalam. Manưih achêk n'nal kơi ađêi praaq rau lalua, đóng adhi anó kung huuiq. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Taai nôôq rau achêk ơi yuur vaaih đóng têêng tajaap paraaq Bha-aar Yaang Pleng: “Yươq ve n'đó ng'haang ưng Ađó e bâân plak.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Mưi dhiq lââng kalóóng Bha-aar Yaang Pleng vil móón: “Piđó e chaling lêi Yaang đu ađêi ơi tak.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Xong nôôq tarnêêng ađek, Jô-seep manưih tââq A-ri-ma-thê, nek mưi môôn-đô ưng Chuôq Jê-su (bơơi kadrêi palââp taai kakhin manưih Jo Thaaiq), ađó nhan Phi-laat đóng đââng xaak Chuôq Jê-su vôôiq. Phi-laat đóng pheep. Kơi achêk, Jô-seep vôôiq lơq đââng xaak ưng Chuôq Jê-su xooq. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Ni-kô-đeem kung tơk — ađó nek manưih bhêêl tââp tơk lum Chuôq Jê-su xók hayum — đââng ting nôôq janươu dyet thum lơq xrơu palơq dhaak galơu, mơ mưi hariêng dhanang kanơng La-ma. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Kơi achêk piđó đââng xaak Chuôq Jê-su xooq lơq pươr xaak palơq bhaai len nek palơq janươu thum, achêk nek ting kơi pheep takóh ưng manưih Jo Thaaiq đóng raleng xaak. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Mat lââng, dhiq dham đu Ađó bâân tateeng đinh ve mưi dham bhươn; lơq kalóóng dham bhươn ve mưi beq ping tame, hơq kalóóng ađek kah ve ngaai glêh bâân tơp. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Kơi achêk hơq, ơi taai tangêi ravang ưng manưih Jo Thaaiq lơq taai xaal ping nek dhiq đan, hơq piđó tơp buur Chuôq Jê-su dhiq ađek.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Yayóng marư-rư tangêi đu tarnââp kalóóng tapól tangêi, biêh dyơq bhêêl pleng kanam, Ma-ri Ma-đơ-leen vôôiq tơk ping lơq lêi dhơl gamak ơi bâân talan tââq xaal ping. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Kơi achêk hơq, ađó mut vôôiq lơq tơk palơq Si-môôn Phi-e-rơ nek palơq môôn-đô tôôh, nek manưih Chuôq Jê-su nh'nhơr, hayơq ađó móón leq piđó: “Palââng ơi patââi Chuôq gluh tââq ping, lơq nôôq yi kah n'nal palââng lơơi Ađó n'dhiq bơơi bóói.” <verse eid="JHN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Kơi chêk nek Phi-e-rơ lơq môôn-đô tôôh gluh leq nguôi lơq vôôiq tơk ping. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Miq bơơr nhiđó mandrươh yuur mut, hơq môôn-đô tôôh mut đâh lơh Phi-e-rơ lơq tơk dhiq xaal ping laloom. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Xong xók kagong chok leq bhange lêi, manưih achêk bâân lêi nôôq tala bhaai len dyơq dhiq ađek, bơơi kah mót leq kalóóng. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Si-môôn Phi-e-rơ, ting tatun tơk dham, vôôiq mót kalóóng ping. Ađó bâân lêi nôôq tala bhaai len dyơq dhiq ađek, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />dyơq beq khan bâân pươr dhiq akoq Ađó nek kah bêch madhiq palơq nôôq tala bhaai len, hơq bâân puôl lóóiq tơơt n'tua mưi dhiq. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Kơi achêk hayơq, bhêêl achêk, môôn-đô tôôh, nek manưih vôôiq tơk dhiq ping laloom, kung jađaang mót; manưih achêk bâân lêi lơq huuiq. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Taai piđó biêh kah ơi n'nal paraaq Bha-aar Yaang Pleng leq tarnêêng Ađó phaai mamông lóóiq tââq kan chêt. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Xong ađek, bơơr môôn-đô vil val chô dham ưng ađêi.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Dyơq Ma-ri nek dyương nhiim tơơt hót nguôi xaal ping. Hayơq ađó drươh nhiim, drươh kóp bhange leq kalóóng ping. <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />Ađó lêi bơơr dhơn pleng xơp aau bhóók chadhah dyơq tơơt dhiq dham tabêch xaak Chuôq Jê-su, mưi chanak tơơt hót akoq, lơq mưi chanak tơơt hót dyung. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Nôôq chanak achêk tamóh ađó: “Amóóq ơơi, kơi amei nhiim?” Ađó ââi bóóp piđó: “Taai palââng patââi Chuôq aku xooq, lơq aku kah n'nal palââng lơơi Ađó dhiq bơơi bóói.” <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Praaq nôôq paraaq achêk xong, ađó palâh chak leq hót hóng nek lêi Chuôq Jê-su ơi dyương dhiq ađek, hơq ađó kah n'nal kơi ađek nek Chuôq Jê-su. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó: “Amóóq ơơi, kơi amei nhiim? Ngaai amei chik chêk?” Taai ađó ngóq kơi ađek nek manưih têêng bhươn, hơq ađó móón: “Abhươp ơơi, la amei ơi đââng paxooq Ađó, nhan móón đóng aku dham đu amei lơơi Ađó, hayơq aku e đââng paxooq Ađó.” <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Chuôq Jê-su dhaloong ađó: “Ma-ri.” Xók palâh lóóiq, ađó móón palơq Chuôq palơq paraaq Hi-baaq-laai: “Ra-bu-ni” (paraaq achêk ngi kluôh nek: “Thêi”). <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó: “Óóq kadhâng leq thêi, taai thêi biêh kah ơi vôôiq tơk paleq Ama ơi; bơơi phaai vôôiq lum adhi anó ưng thêi lơq móón palơq piđó ‘Thêi e vôôiq tơk paleq Ama thêi kung nek Ama ưng adhi anó, lơq Yaang Pleng ưng thêi kung nek Yaang Pleng ưng adhi anó.’” <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Ma-ri Ma-đơ-leen vôôiq, truuih lóóiq đóng nôôq môôn-đô kơi ađô: “Aku ơi lêi Chuôq,” lơq nôôq paraaq Ađó ơi truuih đóng amei.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Xong tơk, xók bhêêl habu blót kalóóng tangêi ađek, nek tangêi đu tarnââp kalóóng tapól tangêi, lơq nôôq palóng dhiq dham đu nôôq môôn-đô tơơt maar bâân kađơp lóóiq taai kakhin manưih Jo Thaaiq, nek Chuôq Jê-su bhral lơq dyương dhiq m'pơng piđó lơq Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Yươq rau ha đóng adhi anó.” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Praaq paraaq achêk xong, Ađó đóng piđó lêi bơơr têi lơq hót bharêêu ưng ađêi. Xók achêk, nôôq môôn-đô maar bâân bhuui marhaal xók bâân lêi Chuôq. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Xong ađek, Ađó vil praaq palơq piđó: “Yươq rau ha đóng adhi anó. Ama ơi kayua thêi ng'kơi, nek thêi kung kayua adhi anó kơi achêk.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Lơq xong xók praaq paraaq achêk, Ađó gahó parhââm dhiq piđó lơq móón piđó: “Phaai pei đơơp Chuôq Yaang Liêm. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />La nôôq ngaai adhi anó lơơi matu đóng, nek matu piđó bâân tarlơơi đóng; la nôôq ngaai adhi anó kadhâng jư lóóiq, nek matu piđó bâân kadhâng jư lóóiq.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Bơơi Thô-ma, mưi kalóóng majêt bơơr môôn-đô, manưih bâân đóók nek Đi-điim, kah tơơt nek palơq piđó xók Chuôq Jê-su tơk. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Kơi achêk hơq, nôôq môôn-đô lââng móón palơq ađó: “Nôôq yi ơi lêi Chuôq.” Bơơi ađó móón palơq piđó: “La aku kah lêi dham đinh dhiq têi Ađó, lơq lơơi kabró têi aku dhiq dham đinh, kung kơi ravơq têi aku dhiq hót naar Ađó, nek aku alua dhakơi e kah huuiq.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Takóól tangêi tatun nôôq môôn-đô Ađó vil tơơt kalóóng đong, lơq Thô-ma tơơt palơq piđó. Xók nôôq palóng maar bâân kađơp mưng, Chuôq Jê-su bhral lơq dyương dhiq m'pơng hayơq Ađó praaq: “Yươq rau ha đóng adhi anó.” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Nek kơơq, Ađó yua Thô-ma: “Phaai lơơi kabró têi amei leq ađô hơq lêi tapaang têi thêi. Lơq nek pei têi amei lơơi leq hót naar thêi. Óóq val xar kah huuiq, bơơi phaai huuiq.” <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Thô-ma ââi lóóiq lơq móón palơq Ađó: “Kakoh Chuôq aku lơq Yaang Pleng aku.” <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó: “Ơi taai amei ơi lêi thêi, hơq amei huuiq. Phươk đóng nôôq ngaai kah lêi hơq huuiq.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Xong ađek, Chuôq Jê-su kung têêng bơk mataai chrih lââng toom mat nôôq môôn-đô Ađó, hơq nôôq tarnêêng chêk nek kah bâân xaraq kalóóng bha-aar ađô; <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />dyơq nôôq rau ađô bâân xaraq lóóiq nek đóng adhi anó huuiq kơi Chuôq Jê-su nek Chuôq Paq Manưih, Akóón Yaang Pleng, lơq đóng adhi anó ve bâân parmông xók huuiq dhiq dhanóók Ađó.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Lơh nôôq tarnêêng achêk, Chuôq Jê-su vil pakah chênh ađêi đóng nôôq môôn-đô dhiq taxiiq Ti-bê-ri-aat. Ađó ơi yuur pakah Ađêi nô kơi ađô: <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />nôôq môôn-đô tơơt palơq xóng piđó — Si-môôn Phi-e-rơ, Thô-ma, bâân đóók nek Đi-điim, Na-tha-na-êên, manưih mađó Ka-na kalóóng parah Ga-li-lê, palơq nôôq akóón padruuih ưng Xê-bê-đê, lơq bơơr chanak lââng kalóóng nôôq môôn-đô ưng Ađó. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Si-môôn Phi-e-rơ móón piđó: “Aku vôôiq trah kadhóóng.” Piđó móón palơq ađó: “Nôôq yi kung vôôiq palơq amei.” Piđó vôôiq gluh lơq jađaang dyók mưi beq bhuông, đu piđó ơi kah rau ve bâân kalóóng hayum ađek. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Xók achêk, xók ơi nek dhahô brương aq, Chuôq Jê-su dyương dhiq xuôr taxiiq, dhơ kơi achêk, nôôq môôn-đô kah n'nal kơi ađek nek Chuôq Jê-su. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Kơi achêk hayơq Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “Nôôq akóón ơơi, kah ve kadhóóng rau đóng đah?” Piđó ââi bóóp Ađó: “Kah.” <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Bơơi Ađó kayua piđó: “Nek m'peq jươl hót tóór atươm bhuông, nek nôôq pe e ve bâân kadhóóng.” Kơi achêk piđó m'peq jươl, hơq kah ve dyóp praan đóng n'drơh ađó padyók taai parbơk kadhóóng bơk bhlơng. <verse eid="JHN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Xong ađek, môôn-đô tôôh, nek manưih đu Chuôq Jê-su nh'nhơr, móón palơq Phi-e-rơ: “Ađek nek Chuôq.” Kơi chêk hơq, xong xók Si-môôn Phi-e-rơ xâng kơi achêk nek Chuôq, hơq pươr aau nguôi n'dhoop chak ađêi (taai ađó dyơq tơơt chak lalôh) hayơq chrơm ađêi leq taxiiq. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Dyơq nôôq môôn-đô lââng nek vôôiq dhiq bhuông (taai piđó tơơt tââq tóór yươq changaai, chapiên n'đơq mơ bơơr hariêng ku-đê), ting galôôi m'beq jươl bing kadhóóng. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Xong ađek, xók bhêêl piđó dhaluônh tââq bhuông dyók leq kakóóng, piđó lêi tapeh óih rahââng dyơq rahôôq, kadhóóng lơq beng mi dyơq boh dhiq papiing. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Chuôq Jê-su yua piđó: “Phaai đââng m'bưưiq nôôq kadhóóng đu adhi anó tame bâân nô leq.” <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Taai kơi achêk, Si-môôn Phi-e-rơ vôôiq đơk lơq n'drơh jươl leq tóór, liêm bing mưi hariêng xââng jêt pe panong kadhóóng gamak. Lơq dhơ ve lóng bơk kadhóóng, jươl ơi yươq bâân tanteek. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “Phaai vôôiq nô leq cha vaar yayóng”. Kơi lââng kah ngaai kalóóng nôôq môôn-đô khin tamóh Ađó: “Amei nek ngaai?” Piđó maar ơi n'nal kơi achêk nek Chuôq. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Chuôq Jê-su jađaang vôôiq hayơq pei beng lơq pađơơp leq piđó, palơq kadhóóng kung kơi achêk. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Ađôk ơi nek chu đu pe Chuôq Jê-su pakah ađêi leq nôôq môôn-đô, tââq xók Ađó bâân mamông lóóiq tââq kan chêt.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Hayơq xók piđó ơi cha vaar yayóng, Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq Si-môôn Phi-e-rơ: “Si-môôn akóón ưng Jang, amei nh'nhơr thêi lơh nôôq rau ađô kah?” Phi-e-rơ móón palơq Ađó: “Chuôq ơơi, ve, Amei n'nal kơi aku nh'nhơr Amei.” Chuôq praaq palơq ađó: “Phaai paar ban nôôq trưưu akóón ưng thêi.” <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Chuôq vil praaq palơq ađó chu đu bơơr: “Si-môôn, akóón ưng Jang, amei nh'nhơr thêi kah?” Phi-e-rơ ââi bóóp Ađó: “Chuôq ơơi, ve, Amei n'nal kơi aku nh'nhơr Amei.” Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó: “Phaai jư kađââng nôôq trưưu ưng thêi.”<verse eid="JHN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Chuôq praaq palơq ađó chu đu pe: “Si-môôn, akóón ưng Jang, amei nh'nhơr aku kah?” Phi-e-rơ ka-ai ranguôq taai Chuôq tamóh ađó chu đu pe: “Amei nh'nhơr thêi kah?” Ađó ââi palơq Chuôq: “Kakoh Chuôq, Amei n'nal bhơt dyóp rau; Amei n'nal kơi aku nh'nhơr Amei.” Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó: “Phaai paar ban nôôq trưưu ưng thêi. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Alua, alua, Thêi praaq palơq amei, xók amei dyơq n'dhóm, amei tư ađêi xeet xaneet lơq vôôiq n'đó leq ađêi kiêng, bơơi xók amei leq takóh, amei e jarơ têi ađêi gluh, lơq manưih lââng e paxeet xaneet đóng amei hayơq đââng tơk dhiq đu amei kah kiêng.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Chuôq praaq rau ađek, đóng chaleq kơi chêt n'đó kơi hơq Phi-e-rơ e têêng cha-iil tabah Yaang Pleng. Praaq paraaq achêk xong, Chuôq yua ađó: “Vêq ting thêi.” <verse eid="JHN 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Xók hangiêk lóóiq, Phi-e-rơ lêi môôn-đô đu Chuôq Jê-su nh'nhơr vôôiq ting tatun, nek manưih kalóóng vaar cha blót ơi ganương leq tadhưa Chuôq, hayơq tamóh: “Chuôq ơơi, ngaai nek đu tamôôp Amei?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Taai kơi achêk, xók lêi manưih achêk, Phi-e-rơ móón palơq Chuôq Jê-su: “Chuôq ơơi, hayơq manưih ađô e ng'kơi?” <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó: “La thêi kiêng manưih achêk bhiêk tơơt lóóiq patơk bhêêl thêi bhral, nek ve rau chóóm pâng tơk amei? Amei phaai ting thêi.” <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Kơi achêk nek paraaq ađô yuur tanđôôr dhiq kalóóng nôôq adhi anó kơi môôn-đô ađek e yươq chêt. Bơơi Chuôq Jê-su kah praaq palơq ađó kơi manưih ađek e yươq chêt, bơơi nek: “La thêi kiêng manưih achêk bhiêk tơơt lóóiq patơk bhêêl thêi bhral, nek ve rau chóóm pâng tơk amei.”<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Ađôk chênh nek môôn-đô truuih đuui leq nôôq tarnêêng ađô, lơq nek manưih xaraq lóóiq nôôq tarnêêng achêk, hơq nôôq he n'nal kơi paraaq truuih đuui ưng ađó achêk nek lalua dhalam. <verse eid="JHN 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Lơh dyơq, kung ve bơk tarnêêng lââng đu Chuôq Jê-su ơi têêng, leq nôôq tarnêêng achêk, la xaraq lóóiq tabhơt dyóp tarnêêng, nek aku kanóq bhơt hóng katiêk patơk mơ kah dyóp dham đóng kađôôq bhơt nôôq bha-aar ơi bâân taxaraq.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>